(1011056, 120552, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve preserved the photographic quality of this image. Clear, interesting and lovely. 9</td>', 'I like how you''ve preserved the photographic quality of this image. Clear, interesting and lovely. 9', '2004-11-15 00:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011060, 117658, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very lovely and engaging still life. The lighting is nice. I do wish there was just the slightest bit more clarity, but I still really like this. 9</td>', 'Very lovely and engaging still life. The lighting is nice. I do wish there was just the slightest bit more clarity, but I still really like this. 9', '2004-11-15 00:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011062, 121246, 6870, '<td valign="top">You found a way to make nature itself form the impressionism in your photo here. Nicely done! 9</td>', 'You found a way to make nature itself form the impressionism in your photo here. Nicely done! 9', '2004-11-15 00:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011063, 121066, 22975, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning piece of artwork... truly.  I don''t know enough about impressionism to know if this totally fits the challenge (obviously, to me, it doesn''t), but I''m not going to let my ignorance hurt this lovely photo.  I can''t wait to see how it was done!! Oh, and you should definitely make this a print or sell it as fine art. <br/> <br/>Coming back and changing my thinking... I just read up a little about impressionism... and I just don''t see how this is an impressionist piece.  I *want* it to be impressionist, so I can give it a 10 because it''s so cool... but I really don''t think I can... I''ve got to change my score, I''m sorry.  It''s the best photo in the challenge, I just don''t think it quite fits the challenge.  I normally give those a 4, but I can''t do that to this piece.  8</td>', 'This is a stunning piece of artwork... truly.  I don''t know enough about impressionism to know if this totally fits the challenge (obviously, to me, it doesn''t), but I''m not going to let my ignorance hurt this lovely photo.  I can''t wait to see how it was done!! Oh, and you should definitely make this a print or sell it as fine art.  Coming back and changing my thinking... I just read up a little about impressionism... and I just don''t see how this is an impressionist piece.  I *want* it to be impressionist, so I can give it a 10 because it''s so cool... but I really don''t think I can... I''ve got to change my score, I''m sorry.  It''s the best photo in the challenge, I just don''t think it quite fits the challenge.  I normally give those a 4, but I can''t do that to this piece.  8', '2004-11-15 00:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011065, 121341, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice effect. It looks like you shot this through a diaphanous fabric? It really doesn''t matter. I like how  you''ve preserved the photographic quality and still met the challenge nicely. 8</td>', 'Nice effect. It looks like you shot this through a diaphanous fabric? It really doesn''t matter. I like how  you''ve preserved the photographic quality and still met the challenge nicely. 8', '2004-11-15 00:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011067, 120919, 22975, '<td valign="top">Great commercial shot.  The colors are wonderful!!  10</td>', 'Great commercial shot.  The colors are wonderful!!  10', '2004-11-15 00:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
