(1011070, 120208, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very engaging, entrancing image. The use of motion blur (?) works okay. The composition and colors are marvelous and your point of view is genius!</td>', 'Very engaging, entrancing image. The use of motion blur (?) works okay. The composition and colors are marvelous and your point of view is genius!', '2004-11-15 00:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
