(1011378, 120858, 2344, '<td valign="top">I like the colours, not sure why you decided to have the top portion of this be a lighter colour. I think you could have done something different with this picture to help it in this challenge.</td>', 'I like the colours, not sure why you decided to have the top portion of this be a lighter colour. I think you could have done something different with this picture to help it in this challenge.', '2004-11-15 07:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
