(1011398, 120208, 27161, '<td valign="top">8 - Good colors and pose.  I think the blurriness gives it an unreal quality.</td>', '8 - Good colors and pose.  I think the blurriness gives it an unreal quality.', '2004-11-15 07:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011401, 120552, 27161, '<td valign="top">8 - I don''t know why, but I''m a sucker for pictures of fruits on trees.  Hopefully, there is nothing Freudian in that.  Aside for the great contrast between the berries and the darkness around the pic, I like the sense of the branch coming forward out of the distance in the upper left side.  Although most of the picture is out of focus it still has a great sense of depth.</td>', '8 - I don''t know why, but I''m a sucker for pictures of fruits on trees.  Hopefully, there is nothing Freudian in that.  Aside for the great contrast between the berries and the darkness around the pic, I like the sense of the branch coming forward out of the distance in the upper left side.  Although most of the picture is out of focus it still has a great sense of depth.', '2004-11-15 07:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011403, 120552, 14386, '<td valign="top">Excellent effect.  The DOF is well-chosen to create this reaching out effect.</td>', 'Excellent effect.  The DOF is well-chosen to create this reaching out effect.', '2004-11-15 07:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011404, 121137, 27161, '<td valign="top">8 - Good pic.  I like the way light is reflected off the feathers.  Looks very regal. eg. Mardi Gras.  I wonder how it would have looked with more feathers in focus.</td>', '8 - Good pic.  I like the way light is reflected off the feathers.  Looks very regal. eg. Mardi Gras.  I wonder how it would have looked with more feathers in focus.', '2004-11-15 07:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011407, 121187, 27161, '<td valign="top">8 - I know it isn''t, but it looks like an incredibly well angled reflection from a lake.  Whatever your intent was, good job.</td>', '8 - I know it isn''t, but it looks like an incredibly well angled reflection from a lake.  Whatever your intent was, good job.', '2004-11-15 07:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011408, 120208, 14386, '<td valign="top">My winner..excellent colors and very good effect. Composition is also great with the angle going along with the stroke filter chosen. 10.</td>', 'My winner..excellent colors and very good effect. Composition is also great with the angle going along with the stroke filter chosen. 10.', '2004-11-15 07:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
