(1011434, 120548, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and lovely work. The staggered multiple image works for me by and large. It''s perfect for the cubism challenge! Colors and composition are effective and very formal. So . . . nice. 8</td>', 'Very interesting and lovely work. The staggered multiple image works for me by and large. It''s perfect for the cubism challenge! Colors and composition are effective and very formal. So . . . nice. 8', '2004-11-15 08:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011436, 121426, 6870, '<td valign="top">This si very lovely to me. I like the lacey flowers, and the gold tones look natural to little ol'' colorblind me. The composition is also quite effective with that twig coming in from upper left and leaving lower right. 8</td>', 'This si very lovely to me. I like the lacey flowers, and the gold tones look natural to little ol'' colorblind me. The composition is also quite effective with that twig coming in from upper left and leaving lower right. 8', '2004-11-15 08:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
