(1011440, 121137, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing abstract. I very much appreciate your attempts at blowing out the highlights to make a painterly feel; I think it works quite well. Superb composition, too and nice, wide, tonal range. 8</td>', 'Very intriguing abstract. I very much appreciate your attempts at blowing out the highlights to make a painterly feel; I think it works quite well. Superb composition, too and nice, wide, tonal range. 8', '2004-11-15 08:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011447, 121071, 6870, '<td valign="top">Dang! You beat me to it. I spent a morning the other day snapping shots of this same grass species. Well, yours is better, but I may still have something in the files to match. This is superbly done. The single inflorescence in focus is well positioned, and well backlit. Super use of depth of field. Nice work. 8</td>', 'Dang! You beat me to it. I spent a morning the other day snapping shots of this same grass species. Well, yours is better, but I may still have something in the files to match. This is superbly done. The single inflorescence in focus is well positioned, and well backlit. Super use of depth of field. Nice work. 8', '2004-11-15 08:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011450, 121187, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice positioning fo your main subject, and very good use of water to reflect. I like how you''ve given her/him an umbrella to stand out more (or captured this that way). 8</td>', 'Nice positioning fo your main subject, and very good use of water to reflect. I like how you''ve given her/him an umbrella to stand out more (or captured this that way). 8', '2004-11-15 08:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011453, 119970, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is very lovely. Highlights and shadows work well with one another. I like the blurriness to the whole.</td>', 'This is very lovely. Highlights and shadows work well with one another. I like the blurriness to the whole.', '2004-11-15 08:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011454, 119970, 14386, '<td valign="top">excellent composition with that foreground lily.</td>', 'excellent composition with that foreground lily.', '2004-11-15 08:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011458, 121280, 14386, '<td valign="top">excellent colors.  I like the composition so much and the visible shadows. Great. Must be on top.</td>', 'excellent colors.  I like the composition so much and the visible shadows. Great. Must be on top.', '2004-11-15 08:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011464, 117435, 8522, '<td valign="top">This photo is just exquisite, one of the best images I''ve seen on DPC. I hope you share your setup with us when the challenge is over. There really is nothing to fault here, the mood of the shot is exceptional. 10</td>', 'This photo is just exquisite, one of the best images I''ve seen on DPC. I hope you share your setup with us when the challenge is over. There really is nothing to fault here, the mood of the shot is exceptional. 10', '2004-11-15 08:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011506, 120858, 8522, '<td valign="top">Oh wow, a great pastiche of a Monet. Very cleverly done. The difference between the haze at the top of the frame, and the very clear leaves at the bottom doesn''t quite work for me... I think the top third of the frame by itself would work much more strongly... perhaps if you had used a higher focal length with the same effect this could have been really excellent. Still, 9.</td>', 'Oh wow, a great pastiche of a Monet. Very cleverly done. The difference between the haze at the top of the frame, and the very clear leaves at the bottom doesn''t quite work for me... I think the top third of the frame by itself would work much more strongly... perhaps if you had used a higher focal length with the same effect this could have been really excellent. Still, 9.', '2004-11-15 08:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011517, 121066, 8522, '<td valign="top">I am extremely fond of this picture, which is now one of my new all-time favourite photos in DPC. I really hope you share your setup with us. I''m not sure how impressionist this is, but I''ll overlook my misgivings. Gorgeous colours, fantastic composition, great textures, wonderful mood, spot-on! 10</td>', 'I am extremely fond of this picture, which is now one of my new all-time favourite photos in DPC. I really hope you share your setup with us. I''m not sure how impressionist this is, but I''ll overlook my misgivings. Gorgeous colours, fantastic composition, great textures, wonderful mood, spot-on! 10', '2004-11-15 08:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011529, 121025, 6630, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been much butter with just the blur, the noise doesn''t really do it for me.</td>', 'I think this would have been much butter with just the blur, the noise doesn''t really do it for me.', '2004-11-15 09:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
