(1011604, 117658, 12332, '<td valign="top">wow - nice impressionism!</td>', 'wow - nice impressionism!', '2004-11-15 10:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011616, 120176, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the sillhouette and the noise in the sky, though the noise  seems to distract just slightly. Lovely colors and effective composition. 8</td>', 'I like the sillhouette and the noise in the sky, though the noise  seems to distract just slightly. Lovely colors and effective composition. 8', '2004-11-15 10:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011617, 120987, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very painterly, but I do wish there was just a bit more definition here. Nice composition of main elements.</td>', 'Very painterly, but I do wish there was just a bit more definition here. Nice composition of main elements.', '2004-11-15 10:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011619, 121066, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract. Textures and colors work well. I like this image. 8</td>', 'Nice abstract. Textures and colors work well. I like this image. 8', '2004-11-15 10:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011621, 121280, 6870, '<td valign="top">I really like the painterly feel to this. The texture of the rock is especially interesting. The light on the subject is also very nice and isolated, adding good emphasis. Fine work. 8</td>', 'I really like the painterly feel to this. The texture of the rock is especially interesting. The light on the subject is also very nice and isolated, adding good emphasis. Fine work. 8', '2004-11-15 10:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011624, 117994, 2344, '<td valign="top">very nicely done! I am giving this a 8 regardless. but I would have liked to have seen something else in the picture.. a couple of leaves or something around the bowl. Very nice picture still. ... reviewed.....bumping you up to a 9</td>', 'very nicely done! I am giving this a 8 regardless. but I would have liked to have seen something else in the picture.. a couple of leaves or something around the bowl. Very nice picture still. ... reviewed.....bumping you up to a 9', '2004-11-15 10:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011633, 121280, 7543, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see this one win, my top pick.</td>', 'I''d like to see this one win, my top pick.', '2004-11-15 10:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011641, 120552, 7543, '<td valign="top">Very very nice, in my top 3, an elegant entry. Composition great,  berries on top of white ring looks great. Great job.</td>', 'Very very nice, in my top 3, an elegant entry. Composition great,  berries on top of white ring looks great. Great job.', '2004-11-15 10:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011648, 121246, 7543, '<td valign="top">Very nice, water looks surreal. Only thing bothering me is the sharpening halo in the top left corner. Top 3, would like to see a ribbon.</td>', 'Very nice, water looks surreal. Only thing bothering me is the sharpening halo in the top left corner. Top 3, would like to see a ribbon.', '2004-11-15 10:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011691, 120552, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely, seasonal entry for this challenge. Wonderful mixture of detail and impressionist textures. Great subtle shades of colour. Composition works well. 10</td>', 'Lovely, seasonal entry for this challenge. Wonderful mixture of detail and impressionist textures. Great subtle shades of colour. Composition works well. 10', '2004-11-15 10:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011692, 121280, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful impressionist photo. Love the figure of the girl. Just the right amount of blur. Great colours, and very effective mood. Great sense of mystery. 10</td>', 'Wonderful impressionist photo. Love the figure of the girl. Just the right amount of blur. Great colours, and very effective mood. Great sense of mystery. 10', '2004-11-15 10:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011698, 121076, 2667, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and mood, and it has a very nice impressionistic effect. One of my favs this challenge. 10</td>', 'Wonderful composition and mood, and it has a very nice impressionistic effect. One of my favs this challenge. 10', '2004-11-15 10:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011700, 117658, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nice result here, I love the halo around the candle light. The textures here are gorgeous, especially the apples. Superb composition. I''m looking forward to seeing how you achieved this, I hope it wasn''t by using PS filters! 10</td>', 'Very nice result here, I love the halo around the candle light. The textures here are gorgeous, especially the apples. Superb composition. I''m looking forward to seeing how you achieved this, I hope it wasn''t by using PS filters! 10', '2004-11-15 10:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011702, 119970, 8522, '<td valign="top">Oh wow, now THIS is a great response to the challenge. Great pastel colours, and I really like the blues. Wonderful use of painting with camera movement. My favourite response to this challenge. 10</td>', 'Oh wow, now THIS is a great response to the challenge. Great pastel colours, and I really like the blues. Wonderful use of painting with camera movement. My favourite response to this challenge. 10', '2004-11-15 11:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011703, 121246, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is gorgeous. An unusual idea to use motion blur to create the impressionist feel. I don''t understand why you left the very ugly sharpening halo around the rocks in the upper-left. There are several ways you could have got rid of this under an advanced challenge. 9</td>', 'Wow, this is gorgeous. An unusual idea to use motion blur to create the impressionist feel. I don''t understand why you left the very ugly sharpening halo around the rocks in the upper-left. There are several ways you could have got rid of this under an advanced challenge. 9', '2004-11-15 11:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011704, 121324, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful example of impressionism, great colours and composition. Not sure your border really complements this picture. I like the selective graduations in blurring. 9</td>', 'Beautiful example of impressionism, great colours and composition. Not sure your border really complements this picture. I like the selective graduations in blurring. 9', '2004-11-15 11:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011705, 121042, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract, great textures and colours. Not quite enough compositional interest for my taste, but there''s a lot to like. 8</td>', 'Nice abstract, great textures and colours. Not quite enough compositional interest for my taste, but there''s a lot to like. 8', '2004-11-15 11:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011706, 120548, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very creative take on challenge. Lovely colours, great effect. 8</td>', 'Very creative take on challenge. Lovely colours, great effect. 8', '2004-11-15 11:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011707, 121426, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely rich autumn colours, I wish the composition was a bit more clean and striking... it''s just a tad too homogenous for my taste. Great use of dof. 7</td>', 'Lovely rich autumn colours, I wish the composition was a bit more clean and striking... it''s just a tad too homogenous for my taste. Great use of dof. 7', '2004-11-15 11:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011708, 120706, 2667, '<td valign="top">Nice feel to this image. I dont see it as overly impressionistic, but I like it nonetheless. 9</td>', 'Nice feel to this image. I dont see it as overly impressionistic, but I like it nonetheless. 9', '2004-11-15 11:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011709, 121341, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice effect, some great colours. The composition is a bit too cluttered for my taste, but a great mood has been created here. The quality of the noise in the greens is not too great IMO. 7</td>', 'Nice effect, some great colours. The composition is a bit too cluttered for my taste, but a great mood has been created here. The quality of the noise in the greens is not too great IMO. 7', '2004-11-15 11:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011711, 121186, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting study in lines, light and textures. Not sure if it really appeals to me, but there''s no doubting it''s a well taken photo. I don''t particularly like it in sepia, and think I would have prefered a colour version. 7</td>', 'Interesting study in lines, light and textures. Not sure if it really appeals to me, but there''s no doubting it''s a well taken photo. I don''t particularly like it in sepia, and think I would have prefered a colour version. 7', '2004-11-15 11:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011712, 119770, 8522, '<td valign="top">An interesting effect, but not really to my taste. Texture comes across as too noisy, and doesn''t really say impressionism to me. 6</td>', 'An interesting effect, but not really to my taste. Texture comes across as too noisy, and doesn''t really say impressionism to me. 6', '2004-11-15 11:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011713, 121425, 8522, '<td valign="top">An interesting flower shot, which I''m assuming was taken through textured glass, or is a water reflection. I think the white background stops this from being really exceptional... the composition is just a little plain as it stands. Nice painted effect though. 6</td>', 'An interesting flower shot, which I''m assuming was taken through textured glass, or is a water reflection. I think the white background stops this from being really exceptional... the composition is just a little plain as it stands. Nice painted effect though. 6', '2004-11-15 11:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011714, 120176, 8522, '<td valign="top">Some nice colours, but the composition of the silhouettes isn''t strong enough, and rather than impressionist textures, I see noise. 6</td>', 'Some nice colours, but the composition of the silhouettes isn''t strong enough, and rather than impressionist textures, I see noise. 6', '2004-11-15 11:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011715, 120971, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the pigeons, which takes away from the composition IMO. I wonder if it would look better with some of the top negative space cropped out. Nice muted colours. 6</td>', 'Not a fan of the pigeons, which takes away from the composition IMO. I wonder if it would look better with some of the top negative space cropped out. Nice muted colours. 6', '2004-11-15 11:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011716, 119385, 8522, '<td valign="top">The inverted water reflection is a good idea for this challenge, but the subject matter doesn''t really wow me here. 6</td>', 'The inverted water reflection is a good idea for this challenge, but the subject matter doesn''t really wow me here. 6', '2004-11-15 11:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011717, 121187, 8522, '<td valign="top">The upside-down reflection gives some nice textures to this photo, but I''m not wholly convinced by the composition. The colours and autumn leaves give a great mood. 6</td>', 'The upside-down reflection gives some nice textures to this photo, but I''m not wholly convinced by the composition. The colours and autumn leaves give a great mood. 6', '2004-11-15 11:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011719, 121137, 8522, '<td valign="top">There are some nice colours and textures here, but I''m not quite sure about the overall effect. I''m not taken by the quality of the blurring effect, however it was achieved, and the composition comes across as haphazard. The burnt out highlights detract from the shot, and I wish there was a tad more detail in the shot. 6</td>', 'There are some nice colours and textures here, but I''m not quite sure about the overall effect. I''m not taken by the quality of the blurring effect, however it was achieved, and the composition comes across as haphazard. The burnt out highlights detract from the shot, and I wish there was a tad more detail in the shot. 6', '2004-11-15 11:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011720, 120712, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours, but let down by weak composition. I''d also have liked to see a little more clarity... it''s too blurred for my taste. 5</td>', 'Beautiful colours, but let down by weak composition. I''d also have liked to see a little more clarity... it''s too blurred for my taste. 5', '2004-11-15 11:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011721, 120706, 8522, '<td valign="top">A little overfiltered for my taste... looks like selective use of the plastic wrap filter. I''ll bet this could have been gorgeous with more subtle use of PS. 5</td>', 'A little overfiltered for my taste... looks like selective use of the plastic wrap filter. I''ll bet this could have been gorgeous with more subtle use of PS. 5', '2004-11-15 11:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011722, 121076, 8522, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really say impressionist to me, and obviously Photoshopped, but it is absolutely gorgeous. Have to take points off for 1st two issues, but will still put into favourites. 5</td>', 'Doesn''t really say impressionist to me, and obviously Photoshopped, but it is absolutely gorgeous. Have to take points off for 1st two issues, but will still put into favourites. 5', '2004-11-15 11:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011723, 120208, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great piece of graphic design, but not sure this really says impressionist to me. It''s more like a cartoon depiction of a Pre-Raphaelite subject. It''s very nice but just doesn''t look enough like a photo for my taste. 5</td>', 'Great piece of graphic design, but not sure this really says impressionist to me. It''s more like a cartoon depiction of a Pre-Raphaelite subject. It''s very nice but just doesn''t look enough like a photo for my taste. 5', '2004-11-15 11:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011724, 120987, 8522, '<td valign="top">The flag and everything else in the reflection is not really clear enough, and I don''t think reflections work too well when too much plain white/grey is in the composition. 4</td>', 'The flag and everything else in the reflection is not really clear enough, and I don''t think reflections work too well when too much plain white/grey is in the composition. 4', '2004-11-15 11:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011725, 118676, 8522, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Setzler''s pic that he became very attached to despite (or maybe because of) it''s poor placement in a challenge. This technique used in this context doesn''t really say a lot to me, and looks a bit gimmicky. It doesn''t come across to me as impressionistic... I don''t feel a mood created by the use of this technique. 4</td>', 'Reminds me of Setzler''s pic that he became very attached to despite (or maybe because of) it''s poor placement in a challenge. This technique used in this context doesn''t really say a lot to me, and looks a bit gimmicky. It doesn''t come across to me as impressionistic... I don''t feel a mood created by the use of this technique. 4', '2004-11-15 11:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011727, 121071, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not sure the white sky complements this shot. However, the subject matter is good for an impressionist challenge but the picture misses that wow factor IMO. 4</td>', 'Not sure the white sky complements this shot. However, the subject matter is good for an impressionist challenge but the picture misses that wow factor IMO. 4', '2004-11-15 11:03:14.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1011728, 120752, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on challenge, but really goes against the spirit of trying to create the impressionist feel in the camera IMO. Nothing technically to fault about this photo. 4</td>', 'Interesting take on challenge, but really goes against the spirit of trying to create the impressionist feel in the camera IMO. Nothing technically to fault about this photo. 4', '2004-11-15 11:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011729, 117994, 8522, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really strike me as impressionistic... I don''t like the quality of noise in the reds. Nice mood here though. 4</td>', 'Doesn''t really strike me as impressionistic... I don''t like the quality of noise in the reds. Nice mood here though. 4', '2004-11-15 11:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011731, 120919, 8522, '<td valign="top">Looks very much like a Photoshop watercolour filter effect, which I don''t really care for here. I''m not very keen on your choice of subject matter for this challenge, which seems a bit mundane. 3</td>', 'Looks very much like a Photoshop watercolour filter effect, which I don''t really care for here. I''m not very keen on your choice of subject matter for this challenge, which seems a bit mundane. 3', '2004-11-15 11:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011732, 121188, 8522, '<td valign="top">Don''t care for the overuse of a PS filter, which looks like the dust &amp; scratches filter, or median blur filter. I''ll bet this was a gorgeous photo before the PP. 2</td>', 'Don''t care for the overuse of a PS filter, which looks like the dust & scratches filter, or median blur filter. I''ll bet this was a gorgeous photo before the PP. 2', '2004-11-15 11:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011733, 120512, 8522, '<td valign="top">Looks like a PS filter... I don''t like the effect on this shot and don''t think it looks particularly impressionist. 2</td>', 'Looks like a PS filter... I don''t like the effect on this shot and don''t think it looks particularly impressionist. 2', '2004-11-15 11:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011734, 121025, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful effect, but IMO has completely violated photographic integrity. 2</td>', 'Beautiful effect, but IMO has completely violated photographic integrity. 2', '2004-11-15 11:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011736, 121343, 8522, '<td valign="top">I very much don''t care for this filter, which makes the photo look like graphic design, and in no way gives an impressionist feel to the shot. 1</td>', 'I very much don''t care for this filter, which makes the photo look like graphic design, and in no way gives an impressionist feel to the shot. 1', '2004-11-15 11:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011737, 121055, 8522, '<td valign="top">Looks very much like a texture filter from PS, which I really don''t care for here. I''m sure your photo didn''t need this gimmick, and would have been much better complemented by Gaussian Blur, or similar for this challenge. Besides, this filter looks more like an oil painting than an impressionist watercolour. Do PM me if I''m wrong. 1</td>', 'Looks very much like a texture filter from PS, which I really don''t care for here. I''m sure your photo didn''t need this gimmick, and would have been much better complemented by Gaussian Blur, or similar for this challenge. Besides, this filter looks more like an oil painting than an impressionist watercolour. Do PM me if I''m wrong. 1', '2004-11-15 11:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011738, 121274, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice... almost Warhol-like, not enough photographic integrity for me in a DPC challenge though, and not particularly impressionistic. 1</td>', 'Nice... almost Warhol-like, not enough photographic integrity for me in a DPC challenge though, and not particularly impressionistic. 1', '2004-11-15 11:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011739, 121422, 8522, '<td valign="top">Looks like this was once a respectable photo. Far too filtered now for my taste. 1</td>', 'Looks like this was once a respectable photo. Far too filtered now for my taste. 1', '2004-11-15 11:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011741, 117658, 2667, '<td valign="top">I like this image right up the right hand edge... where it gets all sharp in a way that it just shouldn''t. It''s visually disturbing.  If far right hand quarter were removed I''d rank it a 9 or 10, but its so jarring with it being there I can only do it an 8.</td>', 'I like this image right up the right hand edge... where it gets all sharp in a way that it just shouldn''t. It''s visually disturbing.  If far right hand quarter were removed I''d rank it a 9 or 10, but its so jarring with it being there I can only do it an 8.', '2004-11-15 11:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011790, 121055, 1202, '<td valign="top">Very nice final result no matter how it was achieved. I love the fence,except I would have liked it to lead me more into the picture, as it is it cuts the picture horizontally.</td>', 'Very nice final result no matter how it was achieved. I love the fence,except I would have liked it to lead me more into the picture, as it is it cuts the picture horizontally.', '2004-11-15 11:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011799, 120706, 1202, '<td valign="top">Very nice final result no matter how it was achieved.  Not a particularly "lasting" picture but interesting.</td>', 'Very nice final result no matter how it was achieved.  Not a particularly "lasting" picture but interesting.', '2004-11-15 11:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011806, 121042, 1202, '<td valign="top">Very nice final result no matter how it was achieved.  With no real topic It doesn''t really keep my attention, but not all pictures have to be photojournalistic either.</td>', 'Very nice final result no matter how it was achieved.  With no real topic It doesn''t really keep my attention, but not all pictures have to be photojournalistic either.', '2004-11-15 11:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011809, 121066, 29455, '<td valign="top">perfec colors!</td>', 'perfec colors!', '2004-11-15 11:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011810, 117994, 1202, '<td valign="top">Very nice final result no matter how it was achieved. Looks impressionistic to me. Nice composition.</td>', 'Very nice final result no matter how it was achieved. Looks impressionistic to me. Nice composition.', '2004-11-15 11:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011816, 120858, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  I am a little torn by the foggy upper edge and the clear bottom edge. I would have liked to see more of the railing as a diagonal in the main body of the image.</td>', 'Nice job.  I am a little torn by the foggy upper edge and the clear bottom edge. I would have liked to see more of the railing as a diagonal in the main body of the image.', '2004-11-15 11:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011817, 119385, 1202, '<td valign="top">This looks like the reflection I was trying to find.  Very nice final result no matter how it was achieved.</td>', 'This looks like the reflection I was trying to find.  Very nice final result no matter how it was achieved.', '2004-11-15 11:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011821, 121187, 1202, '<td valign="top">Very nice final result no matter how it was achieved.  The figure is distracting to me, only because of the odd shape caused by the umbrella/backpack or whatever it is.</td>', 'Very nice final result no matter how it was achieved.  The figure is distracting to me, only because of the odd shape caused by the umbrella/backpack or whatever it is.', '2004-11-15 11:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011824, 120752, 1202, '<td valign="top">Very nice final result no matter how it was achieved.  Novel idea, well executed.</td>', 'Very nice final result no matter how it was achieved.  Novel idea, well executed.', '2004-11-15 11:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011841, 119770, 1202, '<td valign="top">Very nice final result no matter how it was achieved.  Odd that you would choose duotone, as most impression style pics are full of color.</td>', 'Very nice final result no matter how it was achieved.  Odd that you would choose duotone, as most impression style pics are full of color.', '2004-11-15 11:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011848, 120208, 2764, '<td valign="top">oh- it''s a swan - it looked like a snake at first.</td>', 'oh- it''s a swan - it looked like a snake at first.', '2004-11-15 12:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011872, 120987, 9932, '<td valign="top">Nice work. But I feel it has to much white space.</td>', 'Nice work. But I feel it has to much white space.', '2004-11-15 12:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011880, 120752, 9932, '<td valign="top">Edit: WOW! you fooled me :) that is what I get for trying to do so much voting and not spending enough time reviewing each photo.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-22 00:03:39.</i></td>', 'Edit: WOW! you fooled me :) that is what I get for trying to do so much voting and not spending enough time reviewing each photo.', '2004-11-15 12:31:19.000000', '2004-11-22 00:03:39.000000', 1),
(1011886, 120752, 4008, '<td valign="top">What a great idea and creative interpretation of the challenge. I really like it how the glass (I assume?) creates an impressionistic image of the leaves behind it and how you show the artist at work, with both the real subject and the "painting" of it. The touch of paint on the brush is a perfect detail.</td>', 'What a great idea and creative interpretation of the challenge. I really like it how the glass (I assume?) creates an impressionistic image of the leaves behind it and how you show the artist at work, with both the real subject and the "painting" of it. The touch of paint on the brush is a perfect detail.', '2004-11-15 12:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011888, 121076, 4008, '<td valign="top">great atmosphere using mainly light and color, as it should be for this challenge.</td>', 'great atmosphere using mainly light and color, as it should be for this challenge.', '2004-11-15 12:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011917, 117435, 26045, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure what I''m looking at...but it''s beautiful!! I give it a 9, I''m in love...<br/> <br/></td>', 'I''m not really sure what I''m looking at...but it''s beautiful!! I give it a 9, I''m in love... ', '2004-11-15 13:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011918, 121324, 26045, '<td valign="top">This is so gonna win...10</td>', 'This is so gonna win...10', '2004-11-15 13:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011919, 121426, 26045, '<td valign="top">I''m falling in love left and right with these entries...this is beautiful, be proud! 10!</td>', 'I''m falling in love left and right with these entries...this is beautiful, be proud! 10!', '2004-11-15 13:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011921, 117994, 26045, '<td valign="top">WOW. Excellent. Classic. Great colors. Love the textures coming through the shadows. 9!</td>', 'WOW. Excellent. Classic. Great colors. Love the textures coming through the shadows. 9!', '2004-11-15 13:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011922, 121132, 26045, '<td valign="top">What a lovely, soft image...classic! 9</td>', 'What a lovely, soft image...classic! 9', '2004-11-15 13:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011923, 121246, 26045, '<td valign="top">This is phenomenal...a wonderful photo...9!</td>', 'This is phenomenal...a wonderful photo...9!', '2004-11-15 13:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011945, 121066, 22689, '<td valign="top">No doubt : my fav !</td>', 'No doubt : my fav !', '2004-11-15 13:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011971, 121274, 2764, '<td valign="top">Absolutely Amazing! We have a winner here.</td>', 'Absolutely Amazing! We have a winner here.', '2004-11-15 13:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012069, 121280, 6630, '<td valign="top">There''s something about this photo that I really like but I simply cannot put my finger on it.  Good job and good luck.</td>', 'There''s something about this photo that I really like but I simply cannot put my finger on it.  Good job and good luck.', '2004-11-15 14:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012070, 120706, 18667, '<td valign="top">Good allusion (whether intended or not) to ''Waterlillies''.   I am swayed due to it being my favourite painting, and luckily enough it is usually at the gallery in my home city.</td>', 'Good allusion (whether intended or not) to ''Waterlillies''.   I am swayed due to it being my favourite painting, and luckily enough it is usually at the gallery in my home city.', '2004-11-15 14:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012071, 117658, 6630, '<td valign="top">I really like this a lot.  I''ve never been a fan of impressionism but you have pulled it of really well.</td>', 'I really like this a lot.  I''ve never been a fan of impressionism but you have pulled it of really well.', '2004-11-15 14:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012073, 120548, 6630, '<td valign="top">Although this is my choice for the yellow ribbon, I wonder what it would look like if the flower pot and flowers hadn''t been moved.  I don''t know if that makes sense :P</td>', 'Although this is my choice for the yellow ribbon, I wonder what it would look like if the flower pot and flowers hadn''t been moved.  I don''t know if that makes sense :P', '2004-11-15 15:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012077, 119970, 6630, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  It''s one of the best shots I''ve seen in the challenge.  My choice for the red ribbon. Edit: forgot to add, this has an awesome Monet feel to it.</td>', 'I really like this.  It''s one of the best shots I''ve seen in the challenge.  My choice for the red ribbon. Edit: forgot to add, this has an awesome Monet feel to it.', '2004-11-15 15:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012104, 121343, 472, '<td valign="top">i think that everything about the compositino and lighting of this pic is excellent.  however, i think the high noise look with pointilissm brush was not the best chioce for the image. it sort of makes it look lower in quality without conveying a mood.</td>', 'i think that everything about the compositino and lighting of this pic is excellent.  however, i think the high noise look with pointilissm brush was not the best chioce for the image. it sort of makes it look lower in quality without conveying a mood.', '2004-11-15 15:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012105, 120706, 472, '<td valign="top">this is beautiful and understated. one of my highest votes. only beef, seems a little tilted right.</td>', 'this is beautiful and understated. one of my highest votes. only beef, seems a little tilted right.', '2004-11-15 15:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012107, 117994, 472, '<td valign="top">the simplicity, textures and colors in this. really awesome.</td>', 'the simplicity, textures and colors in this. really awesome.', '2004-11-15 15:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012108, 121188, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>Now, this is a lovely image and it abounds in great blending of hues in the sky. This very beauty is the antithesis of the impressionism style. Bumping up on great colorful image because regardless of the challenge it is a a very nice image.</td>', 'returning for comments:Now, this is a lovely image and it abounds in great blending of hues in the sky. This very beauty is the antithesis of the impressionism style. Bumping up on great colorful image because regardless of the challenge it is a a very nice image.', '2004-11-15 15:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012109, 120919, 472, '<td valign="top">this is actually a great composition .. the filter you used worked well here</td>', 'this is actually a great composition .. the filter you used worked well here', '2004-11-15 15:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012111, 120858, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>A very nice and lovely image with very impressive colors. It falls short of impressionsim in that this is more a faithful depiction with a great variety of discreet forms. Regardless, it remains a nice and pleasant study. Bumping up on its sheer beauty.</td>', 'returning for comments:A very nice and lovely image with very impressive colors. It falls short of impressionsim in that this is more a faithful depiction with a great variety of discreet forms. Regardless, it remains a nice and pleasant study. Bumping up on its sheer beauty.', '2004-11-15 15:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012121, 119770, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>This image is more remiscent of an pencil rendition. the image has great movement but lacks the bold effect desired in the impressionism style. The fine delicate texture detail is more the property of the classic masters of the old style. While this image borders on many styles, it does have enough interest to pull the eye and entertain it. Again, the image is good but the subleties and detail places it in a different class. Bumping up on its highly intriguing look. Intriging because it is a detailed image with great shading and yet no spatual depth which is what makes it special.</td>', 'returning for comments:This image is more remiscent of an pencil rendition. the image has great movement but lacks the bold effect desired in the impressionism style. The fine delicate texture detail is more the property of the classic masters of the old style. While this image borders on many styles, it does have enough interest to pull the eye and entertain it. Again, the image is good but the subleties and detail places it in a different class. Bumping up on its highly intriguing look. Intriging because it is a detailed image with great shading and yet no spatual depth which is what makes it special.', '2004-11-15 16:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012129, 121246, 28428, '<td valign="top">I love this photo!! It''s amazing!</td>', 'I love this photo!! It''s amazing!', '2004-11-15 16:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012182, 121187, 22046, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of reflection. Very nice.</td>', 'Interesting use of reflection. Very nice.', '2004-11-15 16:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012187, 117994, 22046, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color and shape.</td>', 'Nice use of color and shape.', '2004-11-15 16:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012191, 120512, 22046, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of some of Monet''s church paintings. Focus on shapes and light.</td>', 'Reminds me of some of Monet''s church paintings. Focus on shapes and light.', '2004-11-15 16:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012230, 121246, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>I would prefer this image to begin at the top right just above the waterfall. Outside of this this is a highly photographic impressionistic image wherein nothing was used but the water movement to create a great image with beautiful patterns of water flowing over rocks.</td>', 'returning for comments:I would prefer this image to begin at the top right just above the waterfall. Outside of this this is a highly photographic impressionistic image wherein nothing was used but the water movement to create a great image with beautiful patterns of water flowing over rocks.', '2004-11-15 16:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012241, 117658, 15497, '<td valign="top">This is a great image, I like the composition and the feel to it. Makes me wanna go back in time! Excellent!</td>', 'This is a great image, I like the composition and the feel to it. Makes me wanna go back in time! Excellent!', '2004-11-15 17:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012245, 120712, 23394, '<td valign="top">while i might enjoy this image without the impressionistic attempt, i am not enjoying looking at it here.  there are some elements i can relate to, but my eyes are having a hard time reconcilling competing shapes and colors.  most of the impressionist work i enjoy allows my eye to soak in and absorb the image; that is not happening for me here.</td>', 'while i might enjoy this image without the impressionistic attempt, i am not enjoying looking at it here.  there are some elements i can relate to, but my eyes are having a hard time reconcilling competing shapes and colors.  most of the impressionist work i enjoy allows my eye to soak in and absorb the image; that is not happening for me here.', '2004-11-15 17:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012253, 120987, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is nice and peaceful.  maybe it could use a little more color in the flag itself, and maybe it would be a bit better balanced if the darks on the bottom weren''t so dark.  all the same, a pleasing image that leaves me with no hostility, wondering how the image was produced.</td>', 'this is nice and peaceful.  maybe it could use a little more color in the flag itself, and maybe it would be a bit better balanced if the darks on the bottom weren''t so dark.  all the same, a pleasing image that leaves me with no hostility, wondering how the image was produced.', '2004-11-15 17:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012258, 121188, 4411, '<td valign="top">While the sunset is stunning, I''m not as taken with the rest of the photo. My eyes keep getting drawn to the black edges along the top of the landscape and the jaggies on top and along the back of the mill are unfortunate.<br/>I do like the way the glow is shaped to fit around the windmill though - very nicely done.</td>', 'While the sunset is stunning, I''m not as taken with the rest of the photo. My eyes keep getting drawn to the black edges along the top of the landscape and the jaggies on top and along the back of the mill are unfortunate.I do like the way the glow is shaped to fit around the windmill though - very nicely done.', '2004-11-15 17:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012260, 117435, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is ok, i guess.  it doesn''t really move me one way or another.  one thing i find a little disconcerting is the juxtaposition of the simple heart over something that almost looks like a discarded insect exoskeleton.</td>', 'this is ok, i guess.  it doesn''t really move me one way or another.  one thing i find a little disconcerting is the juxtaposition of the simple heart over something that almost looks like a discarded insect exoskeleton.', '2004-11-15 17:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012266, 121343, 23394, '<td valign="top">don''t really like the effect here.  not really sure i would enjoy this as a "regular" photo.  the lighting seems a little too strong on the arm and face (although it is perfect on the flower).  the texture seems somewhat forced, and that takes away from my overall viewing experience.</td>', 'don''t really like the effect here.  not really sure i would enjoy this as a "regular" photo.  the lighting seems a little too strong on the arm and face (although it is perfect on the flower).  the texture seems somewhat forced, and that takes away from my overall viewing experience.', '2004-11-15 17:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012272, 121274, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is lovely, very enjoyable.  would have liked it even more if there had been just a little more water action.  all the same, this really captures a mood and feeling for me.  wonderful composition and colors.  i''ll give this at least a 7.</td>', 'this is lovely, very enjoyable.  would have liked it even more if there had been just a little more water action.  all the same, this really captures a mood and feeling for me.  wonderful composition and colors.  i''ll give this at least a 7.', '2004-11-15 17:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012276, 120706, 23394, '<td valign="top">nicely captured, very pleasing.  this is an image to be enjoyed and absorbed.  lovely colors and aesthetics.</td>', 'nicely captured, very pleasing.  this is an image to be enjoyed and absorbed.  lovely colors and aesthetics.', '2004-11-15 17:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012282, 121066, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is ok, but it doesn''t really hold my interest.  to me, this leans more towards the abstract than impressionistic, and i''m not getting enough detail to appreciate what i''m looking at, other than shapes and colors.</td>', 'this is ok, but it doesn''t really hold my interest.  to me, this leans more towards the abstract than impressionistic, and i''m not getting enough detail to appreciate what i''m looking at, other than shapes and colors.', '2004-11-15 17:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012288, 118676, 23394, '<td valign="top">i''m sure this was fun, as well as work.  to a degree, i''d say the results were worth the effort.  as i''m more of a fan of lighter impressionistic images, this one doesn''t really engage and make me want spend a lot of time soaking it in.  on the other hand, you have captured a certain vitality that is not easily discarded.</td>', 'i''m sure this was fun, as well as work.  to a degree, i''d say the results were worth the effort.  as i''m more of a fan of lighter impressionistic images, this one doesn''t really engage and make me want spend a lot of time soaking it in.  on the other hand, you have captured a certain vitality that is not easily discarded.', '2004-11-15 17:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012293, 121188, 23394, '<td valign="top">well, this is interesting...i guess i''ll go on and call it a stunning composition!  the colors are gorgeous, and i really enjoy the negative space.  i''m not sure, but i think i would like it more with a hint of motion blur.  i''ll give this at least a 7.  thanks for the effort.</td>', 'well, this is interesting...i guess i''ll go on and call it a stunning composition!  the colors are gorgeous, and i really enjoy the negative space.  i''m not sure, but i think i would like it more with a hint of motion blur.  i''ll give this at least a 7.  thanks for the effort.', '2004-11-15 17:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012297, 120971, 23394, '<td valign="top">i like the basic idea, but feel the composition is missing something.  maybe the birds are too close to the bottom, maybe there is a little too much or too little space at the top?  i''m not sure, but something is just not engaging me here.</td>', 'i like the basic idea, but feel the composition is missing something.  maybe the birds are too close to the bottom, maybe there is a little too much or too little space at the top?  i''m not sure, but something is just not engaging me here.', '2004-11-15 17:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012325, 121426, 23394, '<td valign="top">the color cast here is a little too much in-your-face for me to find enjoyable.  maybe if it had been muted a little, so as to let the branch stand out?</td>', 'the color cast here is a little too much in-your-face for me to find enjoyable.  maybe if it had been muted a little, so as to let the branch stand out?', '2004-11-15 17:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012399, 120919, 2667, '<td valign="top">Great color, and certainly one of the nicer impressionistic effects... but its just not working for me compositionally and I can''t pinpoint why. EDIT: Once I got home on my bigger monitor this image viewed much better for me (I could see it all at once). 9</td>', 'Great color, and certainly one of the nicer impressionistic effects... but its just not working for me compositionally and I can''t pinpoint why. EDIT: Once I got home on my bigger monitor this image viewed much better for me (I could see it all at once). 9', '2004-11-15 18:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012420, 120752, 23394, '<td valign="top">how clever.  i''m going to mark this one up, just to help cover the cost of the glass.  while some people will ps a shot to death, others will spare no expense in setting up a great shot.  i hope others will appreciate the effort you made for this challenge, as well as the result you achieved.  great job!</td>', 'how clever.  i''m going to mark this one up, just to help cover the cost of the glass.  while some people will ps a shot to death, others will spare no expense in setting up a great shot.  i hope others will appreciate the effort you made for this challenge, as well as the result you achieved.  great job!', '2004-11-15 18:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012423, 121246, 2667, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, I think it would make a great B&amp;W, but I dont find it impressionistic. (It also looks oversharpened).</td>', 'Lovely image, I think it would make a great B&W, but I dont find it impressionistic. (It also looks oversharpened).', '2004-11-15 18:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012424, 117658, 23394, '<td valign="top">very nice job.  right on the money with composition, color, and lighting.  the feeling is quite stirring, and the result is most pleasant.  thanks for your effort here.</td>', 'very nice job.  right on the money with composition, color, and lighting.  the feeling is quite stirring, and the result is most pleasant.  thanks for your effort here.', '2004-11-15 18:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012427, 121187, 23394, '<td valign="top">while you''ve captured the essence of impressionism, i think the leaves actually take away from the image.  i''d probably enjoy gazing at this a little more if the details of the person were just a bit clearer.  as is, i can''t quite tell if they are holding an umbrella, or what.  interesting image, none the less.</td>', 'while you''ve captured the essence of impressionism, i think the leaves actually take away from the image.  i''d probably enjoy gazing at this a little more if the details of the person were just a bit clearer.  as is, i can''t quite tell if they are holding an umbrella, or what.  interesting image, none the less.', '2004-11-15 18:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012436, 119770, 23394, '<td valign="top">this does have an interesting feel to it, especially in the textures.  i think i would have preferred it in color, though.</td>', 'this does have an interesting feel to it, especially in the textures.  i think i would have preferred it in color, though.', '2004-11-15 18:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012441, 119385, 23394, '<td valign="top">very nice effort, but unfortunately, it has the feeling of looking at a detail cropped out of a larger image.  then again, you can''t always control the size of the puddle.  nice lighting and colors.  balance of composition is off, though.</td>', 'very nice effort, but unfortunately, it has the feeling of looking at a detail cropped out of a larger image.  then again, you can''t always control the size of the puddle.  nice lighting and colors.  balance of composition is off, though.', '2004-11-15 18:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
