(1012458, 120858, 23394, '<td valign="top">i don''t know if you washed out or blew out the top of the image, but i wish you hadn''t.  i think this would have been a dynamite image if the top was as sharp as the bottom.  this would have been fine if you had cropped out the top two-thirds.</td>', 'i don''t know if you washed out or blew out the top of the image, but i wish you hadn''t.  i think this would have been a dynamite image if the top was as sharp as the bottom.  this would have been fine if you had cropped out the top two-thirds.', '2004-11-15 19:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012462, 121132, 23394, '<td valign="top">i have no clue what i''m looking at, and unfortunately, the image doesn''t engage me enough to make me want to wander through it and try to figure it out.</td>', 'i have no clue what i''m looking at, and unfortunately, the image doesn''t engage me enough to make me want to wander through it and try to figure it out.', '2004-11-15 19:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012470, 120512, 23394, '<td valign="top">balanced composition, nice colors.  i like the detail that remains, inspite of the effects used to achieve the result.  can''t say that i find the image that engaging, though.</td>', 'balanced composition, nice colors.  i like the detail that remains, inspite of the effects used to achieve the result.  can''t say that i find the image that engaging, though.', '2004-11-15 19:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
