(1012478, 121324, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is beautiful, just wish it wasn''t so soft around the edges.  the colors and lighting are outstanding.  the overall image is just begging for a little more detail to keep the eye engaged for a bit longer.</td>', 'this is beautiful, just wish it wasn''t so soft around the edges.  the colors and lighting are outstanding.  the overall image is just begging for a little more detail to keep the eye engaged for a bit longer.', '2004-11-15 19:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012483, 121025, 23394, '<td valign="top">there are a lot of things i like about this image, and a lot of things i could like about this image.  the post processing is not one of them.  i am trying to judge each image as to how it makes me feel as opposed to the mechanics involved either in camera or post-processing.  i''m sorry, but this one just feels, to me, that you had to go to far to get the result.  if i''m wrong, i''ll gladly retract and eat my words.</td>', 'there are a lot of things i like about this image, and a lot of things i could like about this image.  the post processing is not one of them.  i am trying to judge each image as to how it makes me feel as opposed to the mechanics involved either in camera or post-processing.  i''m sorry, but this one just feels, to me, that you had to go to far to get the result.  if i''m wrong, i''ll gladly retract and eat my words.', '2004-11-15 19:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012484, 120176, 24642, '<td valign="top">Mr Monet. It''s good to see that you are alive and well.  It''s a wise move to move away from the messy paint and focus on photography.</td>', 'Mr Monet. It''s good to see that you are alive and well.  It''s a wise move to move away from the messy paint and focus on photography.', '2004-11-15 19:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012487, 121071, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautiful, elegant, and simple.  i''m enjoying this image very much.  excellent work!</td>', 'beautiful, elegant, and simple.  i''m enjoying this image very much.  excellent work!', '2004-11-15 19:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012492, 121280, 23394, '<td valign="top">this <i>feels</i> cold!  excellent work.  the colors and lighting really get the job done.  it''s not that i''m enjoying this image, but it is extremely moving.</td>', 'this feels cold!  excellent work.  the colors and lighting really get the job done.  it''s not that i''m enjoying this image, but it is extremely moving.', '2004-11-15 19:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012493, 121137, 23394, '<td valign="top">don''t like it.  colors, lighting, focus, dof--sorry, but none of it is working for me in this image.</td>', 'don''t like it.  colors, lighting, focus, dof--sorry, but none of it is working for me in this image.', '2004-11-15 19:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012498, 121341, 23394, '<td valign="top">my first impression?  the title doesn''t fit.  after that, it seems a bit out of balance.  maybe if shot from a different angle, with the more emphasis on the stonework and less on the trees.  the softness also tends to hide too much detail, making through the image, rather than let me leisurely absorb it.</td>', 'my first impression?  the title doesn''t fit.  after that, it seems a bit out of balance.  maybe if shot from a different angle, with the more emphasis on the stonework and less on the trees.  the softness also tends to hide too much detail, making through the image, rather than let me leisurely absorb it.', '2004-11-15 19:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012499, 121076, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is beautiful.  i will easily come back to this time and time again.  great work.</td>', 'this is beautiful.  i will easily come back to this time and time again.  great work.', '2004-11-15 19:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012500, 120858, 24642, '<td valign="top">A beautiful scene.  Truly impressive.  A big plus for not distorting the image too much.</td>', 'A beautiful scene.  Truly impressive.  A big plus for not distorting the image too much.', '2004-11-15 19:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012504, 121042, 23394, '<td valign="top">the colors, lighting, and general composition are inviting, but the uniform application of the texture really takes away from my viewing experience.  if i''m wrong, i''ll gladly retract and eat my words, but as is, this feels a bit over-processed.</td>', 'the colors, lighting, and general composition are inviting, but the uniform application of the texture really takes away from my viewing experience.  if i''m wrong, i''ll gladly retract and eat my words, but as is, this feels a bit over-processed.', '2004-11-15 19:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012505, 120208, 24642, '<td valign="top">This photograph is my highest rated in the challenge, my only 10.  It is beautifully lit and the post processing really enhances the photo by adding a sense of movement.  Congratulations.</td>', 'This photograph is my highest rated in the challenge, my only 10.  It is beautifully lit and the post processing really enhances the photo by adding a sense of movement.  Congratulations.', '2004-11-15 19:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012506, 120552, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot.  reminds me of what i used to do with my telephoto, before i even knew what a macro lense was.  nice composition, dof, and colors.</td>', 'beautiful shot.  reminds me of what i used to do with my telephoto, before i even knew what a macro lense was.  nice composition, dof, and colors.', '2004-11-15 19:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
