(1012536, 117994, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is on track, but i don''t think it gets all the way there.  i think the composition could have been punched up a bit more to make this stronger.  as is, there is a lot of uninteresting negative space that doesn''t add to the image.</td>', 'this is on track, but i don''t think it gets all the way there.  i think the composition could have been punched up a bit more to make this stronger.  as is, there is a lot of uninteresting negative space that doesn''t add to the image.', '2004-11-15 19:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012539, 121055, 23394, '<td valign="top">i think the original would be beautiful in its own right.  however, here, the texture is too evenly applied to make it enjoyable.</td>', 'i think the original would be beautiful in its own right.  however, here, the texture is too evenly applied to make it enjoyable.', '2004-11-15 19:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012541, 121246, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very fine work.  The composition is good and the balance in the dark areas is very fine and makes a triangle which leads the aye around the image.  The colours are chilly and soft but the grass in the foreground really bridges the viewer back to reality from the fantasy.  A big plus for not overdoing the shot with effects but the rock in the top left corner has a nasty halo probably from to much USM.  One of my highest rated in the challenge.  Congrats.</td>', 'Very fine work.  The composition is good and the balance in the dark areas is very fine and makes a triangle which leads the aye around the image.  The colours are chilly and soft but the grass in the foreground really bridges the viewer back to reality from the fantasy.  A big plus for not overdoing the shot with effects but the rock in the top left corner has a nasty halo probably from to much USM.  One of my highest rated in the challenge.  Congrats.', '2004-11-15 19:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012542, 121425, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is ok, but i would like it more if it had a lot more detail.  the colors, lighting, and general composition look like they provided a great foundation, but the lack of detail fails to take me further.</td>', 'this is ok, but i would like it more if it had a lot more detail.  the colors, lighting, and general composition look like they provided a great foundation, but the lack of detail fails to take me further.', '2004-11-15 19:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
