(1012577, 121066, 24642, '<td valign="top">Smooth fluid lines and colour.  Post processing does not disturb which I think is a plus.  There is something about the composition that bothers me though. Can''t really put my finger on it but perhaps a lower viewpoint or a wider shot?</td>', 'Smooth fluid lines and colour.  Post processing does not disturb which I think is a plus.  There is something about the composition that bothers me though. Can''t really put my finger on it but perhaps a lower viewpoint or a wider shot?', '2004-11-15 19:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
