(1013494, 120548, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect. It looks like you used motion blur to create a paint brush feeling. Very well done.  I like your creativeness and attempt at trying something different.</td>', 'Very cool effect. It looks like you used motion blur to create a paint brush feeling. Very well done.  I like your creativeness and attempt at trying something different.', '2004-11-16 10:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
