(1013647, 121066, 4008, '<td valign="top">A great image with fantastic colors. Not sure whether I would classify this as impressionism, more like an abstract. With impressionism I expect to see a real life scene, landscape, people, but then reduced in clarity, concentrating on color and light. This image is an exact and sharp representation of reality as far as I can judge.</td>', 'A great image with fantastic colors. Not sure whether I would classify this as impressionism, more like an abstract. With impressionism I expect to see a real life scene, landscape, people, but then reduced in clarity, concentrating on color and light. This image is an exact and sharp representation of reality as far as I can judge.', '2004-11-16 13:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013649, 120176, 4008, '<td valign="top">A bit too clear and sharp for me to classify as impressionistic.</td>', 'A bit too clear and sharp for me to classify as impressionistic.', '2004-11-16 13:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013651, 121246, 4008, '<td valign="top">A stunning image, I love the cool blue tint. I would crop away part of the bottom rocks. I find it too clear and sharp for me to classify as impressionistic.</td>', 'A stunning image, I love the cool blue tint. I would crop away part of the bottom rocks. I find it too clear and sharp for me to classify as impressionistic.', '2004-11-16 13:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013665, 121324, 669, '<td valign="top">Is this a lens baby effect?</td>', 'Is this a lens baby effect?', '2004-11-16 13:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
