(1013925, 117658, 25042, '<td valign="top">This photo looks very classic to me. The light of the candel creates a great effect. Gret shot.</td>', 'This photo looks very classic to me. The light of the candel creates a great effect. Gret shot.', '2004-11-16 16:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
