(1013930, 119970, 25042, '<td valign="top">It almost looks like a painting.Great colors and processing.</td>', 'It almost looks like a painting.Great colors and processing.', '2004-11-16 16:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013933, 121426, 25042, '<td valign="top">This photo has an amazing glowto it. Great capture.</td>', 'This photo has an amazing glowto it. Great capture.', '2004-11-16 16:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014019, 121042, 3087, '<td valign="top">One of my top 3 entries. I really love the texture in this and the vibrancy of the yellow and the depth of the green is wonderful. I like the way the green leaf-laden branches form large shapes that balance out the strong vertical lines of the trunks and those white lines too. Shame the area at the lower left doesn''t continue that vibrancy - it knocks the whole a little of balance for me. But still in my top 3.</td>', 'One of my top 3 entries. I really love the texture in this and the vibrancy of the yellow and the depth of the green is wonderful. I like the way the green leaf-laden branches form large shapes that balance out the strong vertical lines of the trunks and those white lines too. Shame the area at the lower left doesn''t continue that vibrancy - it knocks the whole a little of balance for me. But still in my top 3.', '2004-11-16 17:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014024, 121066, 3087, '<td valign="top">An unusual entry and one I like very much. There is so much richness in the colours, so much detail to the light and shadow and wonderful sweeping circular edges. I really like that shadowy grid that contrasts with the circular shapes. I think this is just superb and is in my top 3 this challenge.</td>', 'An unusual entry and one I like very much. There is so much richness in the colours, so much detail to the light and shadow and wonderful sweeping circular edges. I really like that shadowy grid that contrasts with the circular shapes. I think this is just superb and is in my top 3 this challenge.', '2004-11-16 17:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014028, 121324, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the ethereal feel of this - I feel like I''m falling in to the image and drowing in that rich colour and the wonderful shapes of reflections on the surface of the water. There is just enough detail in the duck (but not too much) and in the water trail behind it to ground the image and to provide the compositional focal point needed. In my top 3 for the challenge.</td>', 'I like the ethereal feel of this - I feel like I''m falling in to the image and drowing in that rich colour and the wonderful shapes of reflections on the surface of the water. There is just enough detail in the duck (but not too much) and in the water trail behind it to ground the image and to provide the compositional focal point needed. In my top 3 for the challenge.', '2004-11-16 17:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014041, 118676, 9939, '<td valign="top">Excellent impression. Love it.</td>', 'Excellent impression. Love it.', '2004-11-16 17:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014044, 121274, 9939, '<td valign="top">Very nice, ethereal quality.</td>', 'Very nice, ethereal quality.', '2004-11-16 17:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014050, 121055, 9939, '<td valign="top">Normally textures and effects don''t go over too well with me, but I really like the effect used in this case. I''ll be interested to read about what you did!</td>', 'Normally textures and effects don''t go over too well with me, but I really like the effect used in this case. I''ll be interested to read about what you did!', '2004-11-16 17:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014060, 120552, 9939, '<td valign="top">I love how it reaches out towards me- an excellent photograph. Most of the photograph nails the challenge, the berries in the background look downright painterly. But I feel the main subject is too tack sharp and vivid to be considered "impressionism". I would have preferred to see the entire photo with colors and vague shapes to clue me as to the subject.</td>', 'I love how it reaches out towards me- an excellent photograph. Most of the photograph nails the challenge, the berries in the background look downright painterly. But I feel the main subject is too tack sharp and vivid to be considered "impressionism". I would have preferred to see the entire photo with colors and vague shapes to clue me as to the subject.', '2004-11-16 17:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014062, 121076, 9939, '<td valign="top">Love this. Just enough information to give me a feeling, yet with no details. Perfect.</td>', 'Love this. Just enough information to give me a feeling, yet with no details. Perfect.', '2004-11-16 17:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014066, 120987, 9939, '<td valign="top">I like this because I wasn''t able to tell what it was in the fullsize image, it was looking at it in the thumbnail that I realized it''s a flag. Nicely done, good impression :)</td>', 'I like this because I wasn''t able to tell what it was in the fullsize image, it was looking at it in the thumbnail that I realized it''s a flag. Nicely done, good impression :)', '2004-11-16 17:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014074, 120752, 9939, '<td valign="top">Can''t wait to hear how you did this- whether that''s an actual canvas or we''re looking at a piece of glass. Well done.</td>', 'Can''t wait to hear how you did this- whether that''s an actual canvas or we''re looking at a piece of glass. Well done.', '2004-11-16 17:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014077, 117658, 9939, '<td valign="top">Excellent job, love it. Can''t wait to read about how you did it.</td>', 'Excellent job, love it. Can''t wait to read about how you did it.', '2004-11-16 17:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014080, 121280, 9939, '<td valign="top">The whole thing really works for me except for her jacket- the horizontal lines there are distracting to my eye. Still an 8.</td>', 'The whole thing really works for me except for her jacket- the horizontal lines there are distracting to my eye. Still an 8.', '2004-11-16 18:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014083, 121066, 9939, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and pleasant to look at. 9.</td>', 'Very pretty and pleasant to look at. 9.', '2004-11-16 18:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014089, 120919, 9939, '<td valign="top">To me, the Coke logo detracts from this image- the bottles, the figure, the street- all very impressionistic and great colors. Bbut because of it''s size and thus clarity, my eye keeps going to the logo when I''d rather be looking at the figure. If it were me I''d have cropped it so the image was of the figure and the bottles only- but then, I''m not the one with three ribbons, so don''t listen to me :)</td>', 'To me, the Coke logo detracts from this image- the bottles, the figure, the street- all very impressionistic and great colors. Bbut because of it''s size and thus clarity, my eye keeps going to the logo when I''d rather be looking at the figure. If it were me I''d have cropped it so the image was of the figure and the bottles only- but then, I''m not the one with three ribbons, so don''t listen to me :)', '2004-11-16 18:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014093, 120706, 9939, '<td valign="top">I like the concept- but I think my idea of impressionism is different than yours. I would rather see the entire thing with a super soft focus, to give the impression, rather than the specific details visible here.</td>', 'I like the concept- but I think my idea of impressionism is different than yours. I would rather see the entire thing with a super soft focus, to give the impression, rather than the specific details visible here.', '2004-11-16 18:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014098, 119970, 9939, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors, nice impression.</td>', 'Lovely colors, nice impression.', '2004-11-16 18:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014104, 121071, 9939, '<td valign="top">To get just an impression I''d prefer not to see the main subject in such sharp focus- the background gives an excellent impression on it''s own. Nice muted colors.</td>', 'To get just an impression I''d prefer not to see the main subject in such sharp focus- the background gives an excellent impression on it''s own. Nice muted colors.', '2004-11-16 18:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014108, 121246, 9939, '<td valign="top">Wow. Incredible shot. Very beautiful. But in my mind it doesn''t fit the challenge- there''s an awful lot of detail visible, while a crop that included far fewer rocks would have struck me as much more impressionistic.</td>', 'Wow. Incredible shot. Very beautiful. But in my mind it doesn''t fit the challenge- there''s an awful lot of detail visible, while a crop that included far fewer rocks would have struck me as much more impressionistic.', '2004-11-16 18:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014128, 120987, 12962, '<td valign="top">Bumping to 9.  I would have like more definition on the flag especially if you look at it from afar but ... it''s impressionism, and it does leaves a huge impression on the reader.</td>', 'Bumping to 9.  I would have like more definition on the flag especially if you look at it from afar but ... it''s impressionism, and it does leaves a huge impression on the reader.', '2004-11-16 18:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014189, 120176, 28045, '<td valign="top">Awesome, except for the wire running up from left to the right of the photo</td>', 'Awesome, except for the wire running up from left to the right of the photo', '2004-11-16 19:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014193, 120552, 22386, '<td valign="top">Fantastic composition.  Love the way the berrys are highlighted by the light behind them.</td>', 'Fantastic composition.  Love the way the berrys are highlighted by the light behind them.', '2004-11-16 19:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014196, 120919, 27574, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic photo/work-of art.  The composition itself is perfect and the colors work so well.  I even like the slight tinge of purple and blue.  WOW!!...the more I look the more I like it.  It would make a neat painting and an advertisement for Coke.</td>', 'This is a fantastic photo/work-of art.  The composition itself is perfect and the colors work so well.  I even like the slight tinge of purple and blue.  WOW!!...the more I look the more I like it.  It would make a neat painting and an advertisement for Coke.', '2004-11-16 19:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014203, 121324, 27574, '<td valign="top">Ahhh Monet lives and he does digital, lol!  Beautiful work.</td>', 'Ahhh Monet lives and he does digital, lol!  Beautiful work.', '2004-11-16 19:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014250, 119385, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like the effect you have achieved with your picture. It definitely has an impressionistic feel to it.</td>', 'I like the effect you have achieved with your picture. It definitely has an impressionistic feel to it.', '2004-11-16 19:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014252, 119770, 3306, '<td valign="top">A very interesting almost abstract picture. I will be interested to read in your details how you achieved this effect.</td>', 'A very interesting almost abstract picture. I will be interested to read in your details how you achieved this effect.', '2004-11-16 19:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014254, 120971, 3306, '<td valign="top">This picture has alot of potential. I like this type of picture. I find the pigeons to be a little distracting. I think I would have liked it better if you cropped the picture above the birds. I like the contrast between the one tree that is almost fully with leaves and the other tree which is almost leafless. It makes me wonder why.</td>', 'This picture has alot of potential. I like this type of picture. I find the pigeons to be a little distracting. I think I would have liked it better if you cropped the picture above the birds. I like the contrast between the one tree that is almost fully with leaves and the other tree which is almost leafless. It makes me wonder why.', '2004-11-16 19:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014267, 121187, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very colorful and jubilant. I like the filtered effect which truly looks like a reflection. The image of the person is mystifying and interesting.  It makes me wonder what He/She is doing.  Is that a reflection of you taking the picture. On second thought, don''t tell me. Keep it a mystery!!</td>', 'Very colorful and jubilant. I like the filtered effect which truly looks like a reflection. The image of the person is mystifying and interesting.  It makes me wonder what He/She is doing.  Is that a reflection of you taking the picture. On second thought, don''t tell me. Keep it a mystery!!', '2004-11-16 20:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014329, 120548, 4411, '<td valign="top">The rotation is a bit too much for me. It gives a decent painted effect, but almost makes me feel dizzy!<br/>It is growing on me though. Gonna bump it up from my initial ranking.</td>', 'The rotation is a bit too much for me. It gives a decent painted effect, but almost makes me feel dizzy!It is growing on me though. Gonna bump it up from my initial ranking.', '2004-11-16 20:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
