(1014429, 120752, 22010, '<td valign="top">I think this is brilliant. Considering the caliber of your competition, you should be really proud for coming up with an idea that puts of most of theirs to questionable shame. My favorite of this challenge by a long shot. 10</td>', 'I think this is brilliant. Considering the caliber of your competition, you should be really proud for coming up with an idea that puts of most of theirs to questionable shame. My favorite of this challenge by a long shot. 10', '2004-11-16 21:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
