(1014435, 121076, 22010, '<td valign="top">Like many others, the only thing bad about this shot is that it only partially fills the challenge. From what I gather, the style should involve some sort of vertical distortion as well as horizontal. But I like the composition alot. Good luck.</td>', 'Like many others, the only thing bad about this shot is that it only partially fills the challenge. From what I gather, the style should involve some sort of vertical distortion as well as horizontal. But I like the composition alot. Good luck.', '2004-11-16 21:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014437, 119970, 22010, '<td valign="top">I like the colors. I like the post processing effects. I just don''t like to see the doublets. It may be that they''re intentional, but they detract from the picture. Good luck.</td>', 'I like the colors. I like the post processing effects. I just don''t like to see the doublets. It may be that they''re intentional, but they detract from the picture. Good luck.', '2004-11-16 21:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
