(1014661, 121246, 2752, '<td valign="top"><br/>I would have softened the upper left out cropping and the lower left rock formation<br/>to  fit with the rest of the photo.  This is only my opinion based on impressionistic paintings. The overall blue is very good.</td>', 'I would have softened the upper left out cropping and the lower left rock formationto  fit with the rest of the photo.  This is only my opinion based on impressionistic paintings. The overall blue is very good.', '2004-11-16 23:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
