(1015416, 120858, 28764, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.</td>', 'Nice picture.', '2004-11-17 03:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015486, 120208, 16046, '<td valign="top">My top pick, stunning colors, really well done 10</td>', 'My top pick, stunning colors, really well done 10', '2004-11-17 04:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015487, 121042, 16046, '<td valign="top">Excellent color, my #2 pick over all, love the contast here.</td>', 'Excellent color, my #2 pick over all, love the contast here.', '2004-11-17 04:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015501, 121343, 29168, '<td valign="top">This was a very difficult challenge to judge. Impressionism is so very subjective. <br/> <br/>You have produced an excellent emotive and artful image here. For my own taste (subjective) the image is a little too crisp and/or harsh to fit my personal ideas of "impressionism." In a free study I''d have given a 9 as this overall compostion here is just beautiful in it''s communication. Well done. 7.</td>', 'This was a very difficult challenge to judge. Impressionism is so very subjective.  You have produced an excellent emotive and artful image here. For my own taste (subjective) the image is a little too crisp and/or harsh to fit my personal ideas of "impressionism." In a free study I''d have given a 9 as this overall compostion here is just beautiful in it''s communication. Well done. 7.', '2004-11-17 05:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015503, 121071, 29168, '<td valign="top">This was a very difficult challenge to vote on. Impressionism is so subjective!<br/> <br/>This is a lovely image, well composed and very nicely post processed. However I can not personally detect the "impressionism" intended. In a free challenge I''d have rated this an 8. Hopefully others will catch your drift more easily than I. Good luck!</td>', 'This was a very difficult challenge to vote on. Impressionism is so subjective! This is a lovely image, well composed and very nicely post processed. However I can not personally detect the "impressionism" intended. In a free challenge I''d have rated this an 8. Hopefully others will catch your drift more easily than I. Good luck!', '2004-11-17 05:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015514, 120752, 29168, '<td valign="top">Such a difficult challenge to judge with "impressionism" being such a subjective thing.<br/> <br/>In general, I just love this piece. It has an obtuse obviousness about being evidentally an attempt to define impressionism itself through the use of same.<br/> <br/>There is something about the photo-clarity of the easil and artist''s hand breaking the contrast of <i>mother nature vs. the human</i>, which I find somehow unsettling. <br/> <br/><i>So</i> hard to rate amonst the other great submissions!  9. Good luck!</td>', 'Such a difficult challenge to judge with "impressionism" being such a subjective thing. In general, I just love this piece. It has an obtuse obviousness about being evidentally an attempt to define impressionism itself through the use of same. There is something about the photo-clarity of the easil and artist''s hand breaking the contrast of mother nature vs. the human, which I find somehow unsettling.  So hard to rate amonst the other great submissions!  9. Good luck!', '2004-11-17 05:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015518, 119970, 29168, '<td valign="top">This was a very difficult challenge to vote on. Impressionism is so very subjective. This work captures for me the vibrance and fluid vibration of nature in a way I can personally relate. Well done and good luck. 10.</td>', 'This was a very difficult challenge to vote on. Impressionism is so very subjective. This work captures for me the vibrance and fluid vibration of nature in a way I can personally relate. Well done and good luck. 10.', '2004-11-17 05:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015520, 118676, 29168, '<td valign="top">This was a very difficult challenge to vote on. Impressionism is so very subjective. <br/> <br/>This piece is very good. There''s a real visual/audio/feeling transmutational mix here I personally relate to. A very good interpretation of impressionism imo. Well done! Good luck! 10.</td>', 'This was a very difficult challenge to vote on. Impressionism is so very subjective.  This piece is very good. There''s a real visual/audio/feeling transmutational mix here I personally relate to. A very good interpretation of impressionism imo. Well done! Good luck! 10.', '2004-11-17 05:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015523, 120208, 29168, '<td valign="top">This was a very difficult challenge to vote on. Impressionism is so very subjective. <br/> <br/>For me, this piece effectively captures a transition from a hetic worldly life to a caring concentration toward a subject held personally precious. An excellent interpretation of impressionism imo and very well executed. Well done and good luck. 10.</td>', 'This was a very difficult challenge to vote on. Impressionism is so very subjective.  For me, this piece effectively captures a transition from a hetic worldly life to a caring concentration toward a subject held personally precious. An excellent interpretation of impressionism imo and very well executed. Well done and good luck. 10.', '2004-11-17 05:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015525, 121187, 29168, '<td valign="top">Such a difficult challenge to judge given the subjective nature of impressionism. <br/> <br/>This image expressed "wet to the bone" in a clear yet casual manner. It''s a very good interpretation of impressionism imo. The trees and wotnot don''t seem to contribute to me.  I gave you a 9. Good luck!</td>', 'Such a difficult challenge to judge given the subjective nature of impressionism.  This image expressed "wet to the bone" in a clear yet casual manner. It''s a very good interpretation of impressionism imo. The trees and wotnot don''t seem to contribute to me.  I gave you a 9. Good luck!', '2004-11-17 05:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015660, 120919, 23458, '<td valign="top">I think I''d be much more impressed if you somehow managed to do this with just the camera, but its a great subject for a shot like this - almost reminds me of an old Coke advertisement.  All in all - good composition, great idea and solid editing.<br/></td>', 'I think I''d be much more impressed if you somehow managed to do this with just the camera, but its a great subject for a shot like this - almost reminds me of an old Coke advertisement.  All in all - good composition, great idea and solid editing.', '2004-11-17 07:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015664, 119770, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is a particularly great picture... not sure how it will do in this challenge...but very interesting.</td>', 'This is a particularly great picture... not sure how it will do in this challenge...but very interesting.', '2004-11-17 07:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016231, 117658, 1202, '<td valign="top">Good job on a tough subject. A little dark fo my taste.</td>', 'Good job on a tough subject. A little dark fo my taste.', '2004-11-17 11:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016386, 120858, 3306, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and colorful capture. Really captures the moment in an impressionistic manner. Subtle use of fading in the upper part of the picture in no way understates the attractiveness of your entry. Good job.</td>', 'Beautiful and colorful capture. Really captures the moment in an impressionistic manner. Subtle use of fading in the upper part of the picture in no way understates the attractiveness of your entry. Good job.', '2004-11-17 11:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016698, 119770, 8139, '<td valign="top">Nice patterns. Is this water? IMO it''s more abstract than impressionistic. I like it anyway. <br/>Wonder how it should came out with colors?</td>', 'Nice patterns. Is this water? IMO it''s more abstract than impressionistic. I like it anyway. Wonder how it should came out with colors?', '2004-11-17 13:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016706, 120987, 8139, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Abstract and impressionistic at the same time. A bit more saturated red could give more visual appeal maybe?</td>', 'Very nice. Abstract and impressionistic at the same time. A bit more saturated red could give more visual appeal maybe?', '2004-11-17 13:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016710, 121042, 8139, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Great colors.</td>', 'Very nice. Great colors.', '2004-11-17 13:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016712, 121280, 8139, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, great mood. Good colors too. I like this one :)</td>', 'Interesting composition, great mood. Good colors too. I like this one :)', '2004-11-17 13:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016802, 120752, 20889, '<td valign="top">Being that I like to paint, I think this was a really good ideal you have here.</td>', 'Being that I like to paint, I think this was a really good ideal you have here.', '2004-11-17 13:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016803, 121425, 2752, '<td valign="top">I think this would have worked better with the flowers on a colored background.</td>', 'I think this would have worked better with the flowers on a colored background.', '2004-11-17 13:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016823, 117658, 2752, '<td valign="top">Nice technique.I find the jug takes away from the bowl of apples which are beautifully done.6</td>', 'Nice technique.I find the jug takes away from the bowl of apples which are beautifully done.6', '2004-11-17 13:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016876, 120971, 23772, '<td valign="top">The birds and road are a bit of a distraction.</td>', 'The birds and road are a bit of a distraction.', '2004-11-17 13:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016963, 120971, 29511, '<td valign="top">nice trees good light</td>', 'nice trees good light', '2004-11-17 14:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016967, 119970, 29511, '<td valign="top">bravo, one for my memories</td>', 'bravo, one for my memories', '2004-11-17 14:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017037, 118676, 24846, '<td valign="top">Great angle showing the intensity his jamming. Love the shift of colors which IMO makes the image along with the motion...nice representation of a modern impressionist image.</td>', 'Great angle showing the intensity his jamming. Love the shift of colors which IMO makes the image along with the motion...nice representation of a modern impressionist image.', '2004-11-17 14:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017043, 120706, 24846, '<td valign="top">Lovely soft impressionistic shot...</td>', 'Lovely soft impressionistic shot...', '2004-11-17 14:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017051, 117994, 24846, '<td valign="top">Great deep rich color. The grain is perfect representation in your well composed still. Wonderful job</td>', 'Great deep rich color. The grain is perfect representation in your well composed still. Wonderful job', '2004-11-17 14:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017058, 121341, 24846, '<td valign="top">A very contemplative study. The radiance of light passing at through the trees filling your image is very fitting of the challenge,.Well done.</td>', 'A very contemplative study. The radiance of light passing at through the trees filling your image is very fitting of the challenge,.Well done.', '2004-11-17 14:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017064, 121076, 24846, '<td valign="top">A lovely soft image that washes over. I like the varying intensity of lighting.</td>', 'A lovely soft image that washes over. I like the varying intensity of lighting.', '2004-11-17 14:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017074, 121066, 24846, '<td valign="top">A good one too...Love the color and cropping. The large drops provide a unique contrast against the streaked colors. Very neat use of shadow lines, perhaps a reflection of window panes? Great submission. -9-</td>', 'A good one too...Love the color and cropping. The large drops provide a unique contrast against the streaked colors. Very neat use of shadow lines, perhaps a reflection of window panes? Great submission. -9-', '2004-11-17 14:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017116, 120208, 24846, '<td valign="top">Tyndareus would be proud of your represenation of his lovely wife. Great use of motion and the softness created with Leda''s pastel garments. The textures of the masquerading Zeus adds to your wonderful  modern impressionistic vision of this classic Greek heroine. -9-</td>', 'Tyndareus would be proud of your represenation of his lovely wife. Great use of motion and the softness created with Leda''s pastel garments. The textures of the masquerading Zeus adds to your wonderful  modern impressionistic vision of this classic Greek heroine. -9-', '2004-11-17 15:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017118, 120971, 27524, '<td valign="top">Nice capture...<br/>I like that you took it with birds. It adds good detail... just i dont like them beeing at very bottom of picture... would give more space at bottom to make accent on them.</td>', 'Nice capture...I like that you took it with birds. It adds good detail... just i dont like them beeing at very bottom of picture... would give more space at bottom to make accent on them.', '2004-11-17 15:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017120, 119970, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice Monet quality....</td>', 'Nice Monet quality....', '2004-11-17 15:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017131, 119770, 27524, '<td valign="top">Quiet nice abstract... i like shapes and mix of colors.</td>', 'Quiet nice abstract... i like shapes and mix of colors.', '2004-11-17 15:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017133, 120176, 24846, '<td valign="top">Great use of the high iso...a nice silhoette of the bridge and peaks and spires against the vibrant colors. Great work...</td>', 'Great use of the high iso...a nice silhoette of the bridge and peaks and spires against the vibrant colors. Great work...', '2004-11-17 15:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017144, 119385, 24846, '<td valign="top">Neat shimmering quality I like the tree (willow ?) and simple vibrant colors.</td>', 'Neat shimmering quality I like the tree (willow ?) and simple vibrant colors.', '2004-11-17 15:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017145, 120552, 27524, '<td valign="top">Artistic capture... I like those white background spots.</td>', 'Artistic capture... I like those white background spots.', '2004-11-17 15:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017157, 121076, 27524, '<td valign="top">Well done with painting effect... real soft looks.</td>', 'Well done with painting effect... real soft looks.', '2004-11-17 15:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017173, 121071, 27524, '<td valign="top">Wonderfull colors... nice soft looks of focus and weed...</td>', 'Wonderfull colors... nice soft looks of focus and weed...', '2004-11-17 15:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017186, 120752, 18960, '<td valign="top">That is so cool, creative. Tying impressionist painting to contemporary photography.</td>', 'That is so cool, creative. Tying impressionist painting to contemporary photography.', '2004-11-17 15:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017187, 119970, 27524, '<td valign="top">Nice artistic piece... good colors.</td>', 'Nice artistic piece... good colors.', '2004-11-17 15:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017206, 121274, 27524, '<td valign="top">Ohhh... :) looks like modern impressionism...very interesting.</td>', 'Ohhh... :) looks like modern impressionism...very interesting.', '2004-11-17 15:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017347, 121071, 28227, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your ribbon.  This Image already won.<br/></td>', 'Congrats on your ribbon.  This Image already won.', '2004-11-17 16:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017643, 117435, 11800, '<td valign="top">The colors and background are just lovely. The foreground suffers a little from not enough blurring or not enough sharpness. It''s sorta in between and makes me think it would have been better with a lot more focus or a lot less.</td>', 'The colors and background are just lovely. The foreground suffers a little from not enough blurring or not enough sharpness. It''s sorta in between and makes me think it would have been better with a lot more focus or a lot less.', '2004-11-17 17:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017648, 117658, 11800, '<td valign="top">Really lovely. Yhe candle is perfect.</td>', 'Really lovely. Yhe candle is perfect.', '2004-11-17 17:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017687, 121025, 11800, '<td valign="top">The blue, most of the gazebo, the plants and fence look good. The roof and the trees look to jarring compared to the rest of the scene. I wonder if the photographer used selective sharpening for the effect. Hope it''s in your notes.</td>', 'The blue, most of the gazebo, the plants and fence look good. The roof and the trees look to jarring compared to the rest of the scene. I wonder if the photographer used selective sharpening for the effect. Hope it''s in your notes.', '2004-11-17 17:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017723, 120548, 11800, '<td valign="top">Just a fun picture.</td>', 'Just a fun picture.', '2004-11-17 18:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017732, 121042, 11800, '<td valign="top">Looks like a sheet of aluminimum. Good clear colors and an uncomplicated composition. A superb tenchnical study and nice to look at.</td>', 'Looks like a sheet of aluminimum. Good clear colors and an uncomplicated composition. A superb tenchnical study and nice to look at.', '2004-11-17 18:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017757, 117994, 11800, '<td valign="top">The restricted use colors is good as well as the textures. What I find myself doing is looking at whatever it is that the bowl is resting on. It has some great texture to it. This looks almost more from the Renaissance tradition with the precisely outlined fruit and the modeling of the fruit and bowl.</td>', 'The restricted use colors is good as well as the textures. What I find myself doing is looking at whatever it is that the bowl is resting on. It has some great texture to it. This looks almost more from the Renaissance tradition with the precisely outlined fruit and the modeling of the fruit and bowl.', '2004-11-17 18:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017768, 120919, 11800, '<td valign="top">Photo or ps, it still has a nice feeling to it and I''m a mt dew drinker, too.</td>', 'Photo or ps, it still has a nice feeling to it and I''m a mt dew drinker, too.', '2004-11-17 18:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017779, 121425, 11800, '<td valign="top">Water drops on glass? I hadn''t thought of that before.  The whites are pleasant without becoming a distraction by being to hard on the eyes.  Thanks for entering. Can''t wait to read the notes.</td>', 'Water drops on glass? I hadn''t thought of that before.  The whites are pleasant without becoming a distraction by being to hard on the eyes.  Thanks for entering. Can''t wait to read the notes.', '2004-11-17 18:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017820, 121246, 11800, '<td valign="top">It''s pretty with the blues but it looks to much as if it''s just a regular picture taken for any other challenge. I''ve seen the smooth water shots a lot. The oversharpened upper left rock is really distracting. Other than that, if it was another challenge, I''d probably give you a high score.</td>', 'It''s pretty with the blues but it looks to much as if it''s just a regular picture taken for any other challenge. I''ve seen the smooth water shots a lot. The oversharpened upper left rock is really distracting. Other than that, if it was another challenge, I''d probably give you a high score.', '2004-11-17 18:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017888, 121066, 12998, '<td valign="top">my favorite, hope you get the blue ribbon</td>', 'my favorite, hope you get the blue ribbon', '2004-11-17 18:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
