(1018750, 121076, 29228, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but way to blurry. i know what you were trying to go for, but it is too soft.</td>', 'Nice shot, but way to blurry. i know what you were trying to go for, but it is too soft.', '2004-11-17 23:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018776, 117658, 12253, '<td valign="top">Clearly one of the best shots in this challenge.  Nice work!</td>', 'Clearly one of the best shots in this challenge.  Nice work!', '2004-11-17 23:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018782, 120208, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful mix of slight motion blur and colors.  It doesn''t look like natural motion blur to me, however, as there are inconsistencies with what''s blurred and how much, but it''s pretty close, and effectively done.  Choice of scene and composition are excellent.  Very nice work.</td>', 'Beautiful mix of slight motion blur and colors.  It doesn''t look like natural motion blur to me, however, as there are inconsistencies with what''s blurred and how much, but it''s pretty close, and effectively done.  Choice of scene and composition are excellent.  Very nice work.', '2004-11-17 23:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018784, 120548, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject and  very neat effect.  At first it looked like ordinar motion blur, but I see it really does have a strobe effect here, so it must have been done differently.</td>', 'Good choice of subject and  very neat effect.  At first it looked like ordinar motion blur, but I see it really does have a strobe effect here, so it must have been done differently.', '2004-11-17 23:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018786, 119970, 12253, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully painterly and impressionistic.  Well done.  If I would change anything here it would be to try and avoid the strong whites in the foreground flower.   But the overall effect is excellent.</td>', 'Wonderfully painterly and impressionistic.  Well done.  If I would change anything here it would be to try and avoid the strong whites in the foreground flower.   But the overall effect is excellent.', '2004-11-17 23:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018790, 120752, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very creative take on the challenge and well done!</td>', 'Very creative take on the challenge and well done!', '2004-11-17 23:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018834, 120919, 19608, '<td valign="top">You have created an extremely effective "painterly" look with this classic image of America.  To me, it''s a combination of a Norman Rockwell subject painted in the impressionistic style.  Suberly done and I sure hope it ribbons.</td>', 'You have created an extremely effective "painterly" look with this classic image of America.  To me, it''s a combination of a Norman Rockwell subject painted in the impressionistic style.  Suberly done and I sure hope it ribbons.', '2004-11-18 00:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018835, 121274, 19608, '<td valign="top">A simple subject done in an extremely effective way.  This looks more like a painting than most of the ebtries - I really hope it does well.</td>', 'A simple subject done in an extremely effective way.  This looks more like a painting than most of the ebtries - I really hope it does well.', '2004-11-18 00:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018839, 121324, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great find!  Colors are very magic.  The image seems to "explode" as if you zoomed the lens.  I don''t think the wide white border is appropriate - but it is a great entry for the challenge subject.</td>', 'Great find!  Colors are very magic.  The image seems to "explode" as if you zoomed the lens.  I don''t think the wide white border is appropriate - but it is a great entry for the challenge subject.', '2004-11-18 00:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018847, 120971, 19608, '<td valign="top">You have an extremly strong entry - the fog is magical!  It''s not that "painterly" when compared to some others - but it is more "camera realistic" than most.  The road? in the bottom bothers me a bit as it isn''t needed to make your statement.  Finally - a small point - I''d like to remove the seagull on the left - leaving just a triangle of three of them.</td>', 'You have an extremly strong entry - the fog is magical!  It''s not that "painterly" when compared to some others - but it is more "camera realistic" than most.  The road? in the bottom bothers me a bit as it isn''t needed to make your statement.  Finally - a small point - I''d like to remove the seagull on the left - leaving just a triangle of three of them.', '2004-11-18 00:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018848, 121076, 19608, '<td valign="top">Colors are wonderful - and it sure does look like a painting.</td>', 'Colors are wonderful - and it sure does look like a painting.', '2004-11-18 00:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018850, 121042, 19608, '<td valign="top">I can certainly see this as a 20x30 - hanging on a lobby wall of a major big-city office building.  Well done - and very appropriate for the impressionistic challenge.</td>', 'I can certainly see this as a 20x30 - hanging on a lobby wall of a major big-city office building.  Well done - and very appropriate for the impressionistic challenge.', '2004-11-18 00:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018852, 121071, 19608, '<td valign="top">Your soft muted colors add to the effect of impressionism, but the subject has little emotional  impact for me.  The strong white area at the top draws way too much attention.</td>', 'Your soft muted colors add to the effect of impressionism, but the subject has little emotional  impact for me.  The strong white area at the top draws way too much attention.', '2004-11-18 00:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018853, 121132, 19608, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the circles are - but the image is really magical.  The colors don''t suggest Christmas to me - but I don''t let titles affect my judgement.  The strong black/white border really grabs too much attention from an image that can certainly speak for itself.</td>', 'I''m not sure what the circles are - but the image is really magical.  The colors don''t suggest Christmas to me - but I don''t let titles affect my judgement.  The strong black/white border really grabs too much attention from an image that can certainly speak for itself.', '2004-11-18 00:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019077, 117658, 20375, '<td valign="top">My Favourite in this challenge....10!<br/>You''ve created the impressionistic feel in this photo (you obviously studied some impressionistic paintings to understand the effect) . This one better ribbon.<br/>AND...I gotta know how you did this. Was it through a textured glass?</td>', 'My Favourite in this challenge....10!You''ve created the impressionistic feel in this photo (you obviously studied some impressionistic paintings to understand the effect) . This one better ribbon.AND...I gotta know how you did this. Was it through a textured glass?', '2004-11-18 05:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019079, 120752, 20375, '<td valign="top">I love it. Very imaginative. Creativity plus!<br/>Excellent effort...Enjoy your ribbon!<br/></td>', 'I love it. Very imaginative. Creativity plus!Excellent effort...Enjoy your ribbon!', '2004-11-18 05:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
