(1019877, 121076, 28623, '<td valign="top">A beauty!  This is serenity personified.   You have done a beautiful job.</td>', 'A beauty!  This is serenity personified.   You have done a beautiful job.', '2004-11-18 14:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019880, 121280, 28623, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  I like the colors, the subject with movement, the light.  I like it all the way around.  It will finish in the top three for sure.</td>', 'Excellent.  I like the colors, the subject with movement, the light.  I like it all the way around.  It will finish in the top three for sure.', '2004-11-18 14:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019885, 120548, 28623, '<td valign="top">I think this is a beauty.  It is very eye catching.  The choice of background is outstanding.   All around excellence.</td>', 'I think this is a beauty.  It is very eye catching.  The choice of background is outstanding.   All around excellence.', '2004-11-18 14:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020387, 121132, 19708, '<td valign="top">I really don''t see impressionism here personally.<br/>Nice greeting card appearance though.</td>', 'I really don''t see impressionism here personally.Nice greeting card appearance though.', '2004-11-18 18:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020746, 117994, 28261, '<td valign="top">I loved this composition.  The grain and coloration appear to have been brushed on with actual paint.  The edge artifacts on the pear lift it off the canvas and still I have this sneaking suspision that you used a 2500 speed ISO a very small aperture and the lowest form of candle light possible.</td>', 'I loved this composition.  The grain and coloration appear to have been brushed on with actual paint.  The edge artifacts on the pear lift it off the canvas and still I have this sneaking suspision that you used a 2500 speed ISO a very small aperture and the lowest form of candle light possible.', '2004-11-18 21:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020759, 120176, 28261, '<td valign="top">The overwhelming orange of the sky and the perfect orientation of the bridge work pushed this one over the top for me.  Great use of lower third vs top 2/3s and balanced with the Left Tall one-third, right low 2/3s.  Although I was later able to make out the supporting wire/power line, It''s position once again in the exact spot it needed to be in no way detracted from the whole.</td>', 'The overwhelming orange of the sky and the perfect orientation of the bridge work pushed this one over the top for me.  Great use of lower third vs top 2/3s and balanced with the Left Tall one-third, right low 2/3s.  Although I was later able to make out the supporting wire/power line, It''s position once again in the exact spot it needed to be in no way detracted from the whole.', '2004-11-18 21:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020768, 117658, 28261, '<td valign="top">I''m thinking multiple layers of saran wrap here, with vaseline maybe smudged on it as well.  Whatever the technique, this one was the last (or first as you wish to look at it) one that I let convince me into giving a ten.  To take a picture that I can already see without abstracting it would have been beautiful, but to be able then to translate that great shot into a faux painting...very nice :-)</td>', 'I''m thinking multiple layers of saran wrap here, with vaseline maybe smudged on it as well.  Whatever the technique, this one was the last (or first as you wish to look at it) one that I let convince me into giving a ten.  To take a picture that I can already see without abstracting it would have been beautiful, but to be able then to translate that great shot into a faux painting...very nice :-)', '2004-11-18 21:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020772, 121066, 28261, '<td valign="top">I really like the balance of thirds on this one, the contrast of the large and small circles against the lines of the painted prism, somehow the reflection in the green seemed too burnt/blurred compared to the rest of the picture, but I still had to give this an almost perfect.</td>', 'I really like the balance of thirds on this one, the contrast of the large and small circles against the lines of the painted prism, somehow the reflection in the green seemed too burnt/blurred compared to the rest of the picture, but I still had to give this an almost perfect.', '2004-11-18 21:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020787, 121076, 28261, '<td valign="top">Monet...Monet?  Simply beautiful.  I feel like this whole challenge is a personal museum tour and I don''t even have to leave home.  It was hard not to push this one into the one-of-three 10-slots I restricted myself to in this challenge.  Each time a 9 was placed, it was for the most pitiful of picky things.  I only could say here that the left lower corner appeared burned.  Otherwise, there is nothing I could offer in critique.</td>', 'Monet...Monet?  Simply beautiful.  I feel like this whole challenge is a personal museum tour and I don''t even have to leave home.  It was hard not to push this one into the one-of-three 10-slots I restricted myself to in this challenge.  Each time a 9 was placed, it was for the most pitiful of picky things.  I only could say here that the left lower corner appeared burned.  Otherwise, there is nothing I could offer in critique.', '2004-11-18 21:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020800, 121055, 28261, '<td valign="top">This should be hanging on a museum wall.  Very nice.  I loved the texture used to achieve the look, but it seemed to get washed away in the highlights and is the only thing that gives the ''picture'' away for what it really is.</td>', 'This should be hanging on a museum wall.  Very nice.  I loved the texture used to achieve the look, but it seemed to get washed away in the highlights and is the only thing that gives the ''picture'' away for what it really is.', '2004-11-18 21:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020804, 121274, 28261, '<td valign="top">Excellent crop and lines versus curves.  Something about the surge in the left became too distracting to me - like you had any control of the water....  Very high marks!</td>', 'Excellent crop and lines versus curves.  Something about the surge in the left became too distracting to me - like you had any control of the water....  Very high marks!', '2004-11-18 21:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020812, 121187, 4793, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites</td>', 'One of my favorites', '2004-11-18 21:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020813, 121422, 4793, '<td valign="top">Excellent</td>', 'Excellent', '2004-11-18 21:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020814, 119970, 28261, '<td valign="top">This is excellent work.  Looks like a combination of camera movement and multiple ripples to do the hard work.  Upper right corner''s dark area seemed like it was not in synch with the resot of it, but I still had a very hard time when it came to deciding if this was one of the three 10''s.</td>', 'This is excellent work.  Looks like a combination of camera movement and multiple ripples to do the hard work.  Upper right corner''s dark area seemed like it was not in synch with the resot of it, but I still had a very hard time when it came to deciding if this was one of the three 10''s.', '2004-11-18 21:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020821, 120512, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice artistic shot</td>', 'Nice artistic shot', '2004-11-18 21:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020823, 121341, 28261, '<td valign="top">I love this photo.  The effect is very powerful even without the title it would have touched a deep chord.  I gave you high marks, but it seemed too photo, not enough impression.  Can I get away with actually saying it seems like it needed MORE noise?  I think I need to go to confession....</td>', 'I love this photo.  The effect is very powerful even without the title it would have touched a deep chord.  I gave you high marks, but it seemed too photo, not enough impression.  Can I get away with actually saying it seems like it needed MORE noise?  I think I need to go to confession....', '2004-11-18 21:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020826, 120752, 4793, '<td valign="top">My favorite</td>', 'My favorite', '2004-11-18 21:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020828, 120208, 4793, '<td valign="top">A winner</td>', 'A winner', '2004-11-18 21:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020832, 121280, 28261, '<td valign="top">Curious about how you got the blue/white light contrast.  Something in the wall and her jacket seemed to cause your camera to draw lines through her.  Otherwise this is yet another of those top-scoring submissions in this very talented challenge.</td>', 'Curious about how you got the blue/white light contrast.  Something in the wall and her jacket seemed to cause your camera to draw lines through her.  Otherwise this is yet another of those top-scoring submissions in this very talented challenge.', '2004-11-18 21:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020838, 121187, 28261, '<td valign="top">This picture haunted me.  I had to view it on a CRT to finally realize that the gamma had gone on my home LCD.  When I first saw it I could not see the umbrella and it looked like a headless person holding a mirror.  I like this shot very much, but the leaves in the lower corner are too much of a reality check.  Great technique in the impressionism!</td>', 'This picture haunted me.  I had to view it on a CRT to finally realize that the gamma had gone on my home LCD.  When I first saw it I could not see the umbrella and it looked like a headless person holding a mirror.  I like this shot very much, but the leaves in the lower corner are too much of a reality check.  Great technique in the impressionism!', '2004-11-18 21:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020850, 121426, 28261, '<td valign="top">I guessing this was a powerful yellow filter or a Photshop RAW tweak all the way to the left.  Regardless I like the lines and the opposite corners upperR/lowerL and the balance is great.  With all the emphasis on blur/fade/scratch technique in the rest of this challenge I actually found myself wishing that the upper-center branch was more in focus.  High Marks</td>', 'I guessing this was a powerful yellow filter or a Photshop RAW tweak all the way to the left.  Regardless I like the lines and the opposite corners upperR/lowerL and the balance is great.  With all the emphasis on blur/fade/scratch technique in the rest of this challenge I actually found myself wishing that the upper-center branch was more in focus.  High Marks', '2004-11-18 21:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020857, 121042, 28261, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm this challenge is like a game to find out how you all did this.  Looks like a reflection and 180 rotation.  Excellent tecnique whatever it was, but the Pines looked more on the trunk side than the pine side.  Still like the far majority of this challenge, you got some high scores on this one.</td>', 'Hmmmm this challenge is like a game to find out how you all did this.  Looks like a reflection and 180 rotation.  Excellent tecnique whatever it was, but the Pines looked more on the trunk side than the pine side.  Still like the far majority of this challenge, you got some high scores on this one.', '2004-11-18 21:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020862, 120919, 28261, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of my father''s store when I was growing up.  How many times I saw this scene in the rain and fog, hauling the soda into the walk-in cooler.  You unfortunately could not control his movements as I think this would have been even more perfect if the white bay behind him could have been eliminated and only the open bay with the red bays in the background.</td>', 'Reminds me of my father''s store when I was growing up.  How many times I saw this scene in the rain and fog, hauling the soda into the walk-in cooler.  You unfortunately could not control his movements as I think this would have been even more perfect if the white bay behind him could have been eliminated and only the open bay with the red bays in the background.', '2004-11-18 21:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020863, 121246, 28261, '<td valign="top">I love the angel hair effect of time lapse on this kind of water.  As a photo, this gets high marks alone for composition.  Even tho the left side seems heavy at first with the peak and foreground it is nicely offset by the 2/3 sky.  Too much photo in the foreground tho to push it over the top for impression.</td>', 'I love the angel hair effect of time lapse on this kind of water.  As a photo, this gets high marks alone for composition.  Even tho the left side seems heavy at first with the peak and foreground it is nicely offset by the 2/3 sky.  Too much photo in the foreground tho to push it over the top for impression.', '2004-11-18 21:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020866, 119385, 28261, '<td valign="top">Nicely simple and one of the few times that level roof lines really would have detracted from a pic, in fact, it lends nicely to the art that may be present in a perspective piece and the watery impressionism filter you chose was just enough.</td>', 'Nicely simple and one of the few times that level roof lines really would have detracted from a pic, in fact, it lends nicely to the art that may be present in a perspective piece and the watery impressionism filter you chose was just enough.', '2004-11-18 21:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020869, 118676, 28261, '<td valign="top">Clapton?  I like this effect more and more each time I view it, but the ''second'' exposure in his chin to nose area freaks me out too much like there is a trapped soul screaming to get out.</td>', 'Clapton?  I like this effect more and more each time I view it, but the ''second'' exposure in his chin to nose area freaks me out too much like there is a trapped soul screaming to get out.', '2004-11-18 21:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020906, 121137, 3306, '<td valign="top">Really neat effect. Colors and lighting are outstanding. Very creative.</td>', 'Really neat effect. Colors and lighting are outstanding. Very creative.', '2004-11-18 22:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020912, 121422, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very interesting filter. I will be interested to see how you accomplished this very eery effect. Good job.</td>', 'Very interesting filter. I will be interested to see how you accomplished this very eery effect. Good job.', '2004-11-18 22:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020918, 121076, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very smooth. You have made an average scene quite unique.</td>', 'Very smooth. You have made an average scene quite unique.', '2004-11-18 22:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021283, 121280, 25464, '<td valign="top">Very moody.  Love the colors and emotion.</td>', 'Very moody.  Love the colors and emotion.', '2004-11-19 00:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021291, 121425, 19708, '<td valign="top">Very simplistic approach, yet very effective.<br/>Met the challenge head on!<br/>Nicely Done! ((9))<br/></td>', 'Very simplistic approach, yet very effective.Met the challenge head on!Nicely Done! ((9))', '2004-11-19 00:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021305, 120208, 8624, '<td valign="top">beautiful. I love the point of view and the muted colors. I was surprised to see so few portraits, but if this is one of the only examples, it is a fine representation of what an impressionistic portrait should be</td>', 'beautiful. I love the point of view and the muted colors. I was surprised to see so few portraits, but if this is one of the only examples, it is a fine representation of what an impressionistic portrait should be', '2004-11-19 01:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021306, 119770, 8624, '<td valign="top">simple and elegant. a nice study of form and tone.</td>', 'simple and elegant. a nice study of form and tone.', '2004-11-19 01:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021309, 120971, 8624, '<td valign="top">I think I would have preferred this as a black and white image. the strip of color in the grass distracts from an otherwise very nice tonal study. I like the birds in the foreground</td>', 'I think I would have preferred this as a black and white image. the strip of color in the grass distracts from an otherwise very nice tonal study. I like the birds in the foreground', '2004-11-19 01:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021312, 120858, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the splash of color and the repeating patterns in the leaves. I wish the bridge at the top wasn''t fading away so much though.</td>', 'I like the splash of color and the repeating patterns in the leaves. I wish the bridge at the top wasn''t fading away so much though.', '2004-11-19 01:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021314, 121426, 8624, '<td valign="top">great tones. I like the warm golden colors here.</td>', 'great tones. I like the warm golden colors here.', '2004-11-19 01:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021324, 120548, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the effect here. It is interesting to add motion to what would normally be a still life.It works for me. I''ll be interested in reading how you created the effect. nice job!</td>', 'I like the effect here. It is interesting to add motion to what would normally be a still life.It works for me. I''ll be interested in reading how you created the effect. nice job!', '2004-11-19 01:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021331, 120919, 8624, '<td valign="top">I love this. I like all the neatly stacked bottled, the big Coke logo and the man''s hooded sweatshirt. Even without the glass filter effect, I think this is a terrific "slice of life" shot. I hope you post the original after the challenge.  My favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'I love this. I like all the neatly stacked bottled, the big Coke logo and the man''s hooded sweatshirt. Even without the glass filter effect, I think this is a terrific "slice of life" shot. I hope you post the original after the challenge.  My favorite of the challenge.', '2004-11-19 01:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021585, 121422, 28261, '<td valign="top">Something in the edge artifacts reminded me more of layers of construction paper rather than paint.</td>', 'Something in the edge artifacts reminded me more of layers of construction paper rather than paint.', '2004-11-19 05:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021586, 120706, 28261, '<td valign="top">I liked the haze/blur and the edging of the ripples, but found the leaves and raindrops to be too crisp to be fully impressionistic.</td>', 'I liked the haze/blur and the edging of the ripples, but found the leaves and raindrops to be too crisp to be fully impressionistic.', '2004-11-19 05:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021588, 117435, 28261, '<td valign="top">I like the impact of the background, but the crisp edges of the heart seem out of place.</td>', 'I like the impact of the background, but the crisp edges of the heart seem out of place.', '2004-11-19 05:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021592, 121425, 28261, '<td valign="top">Looking at my patio furniture last night as I pondered this challenge I realized how you got this effect.  Very nice, but the shower wall is too white, perhaps a pastel towel in the background would have lessened the contrast.</td>', 'Looking at my patio furniture last night as I pondered this challenge I realized how you got this effect.  Very nice, but the shower wall is too white, perhaps a pastel towel in the background would have lessened the contrast.', '2004-11-19 05:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021594, 121343, 28261, '<td valign="top">I liked the picture very much, but it seems the scratch effects are somewhat understated.  Was this done in PS or with a very heavy nylon over the lens?</td>', 'I liked the picture very much, but it seems the scratch effects are somewhat understated.  Was this done in PS or with a very heavy nylon over the lens?', '2004-11-19 05:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021598, 120548, 28261, '<td valign="top">This one eludes me.  If the lens is tripod mounted, the camera body could rotate on a slight zoom, but there seems to be no zoom effect.  If the body were tripod mounted, the center rotation would move and not stay centered.  The plant doesn''t look like it''s spring loaded...how''d you do this one?  I liked it very much but the red swatch streak in the left corner seemed way out of place.</td>', 'This one eludes me.  If the lens is tripod mounted, the camera body could rotate on a slight zoom, but there seems to be no zoom effect.  If the body were tripod mounted, the center rotation would move and not stay centered.  The plant doesn''t look like it''s spring loaded...how''d you do this one?  I liked it very much but the red swatch streak in the left corner seemed way out of place.', '2004-11-19 05:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021604, 119770, 28261, '<td valign="top">I see mountains made of molehills and rain in the form of a wall of water.  Looks like your were very close to the action too.  Some of the wetness appears to have stuck on the lens.  Hope you didn''t get your camera soaked doing this one.</td>', 'I see mountains made of molehills and rain in the form of a wall of water.  Looks like your were very close to the action too.  Some of the wetness appears to have stuck on the lens.  Hope you didn''t get your camera soaked doing this one.', '2004-11-19 05:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021607, 120512, 28261, '<td valign="top">I really liked the flow of this picture, but felt the contrast/detail was too high.</td>', 'I really liked the flow of this picture, but felt the contrast/detail was too high.', '2004-11-19 06:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021609, 121188, 28261, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot.  The colors are warm and inviting and the effect of ''washing out'' the detail (no wood on the side of the mill, the grass all blends as one) really works well.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot.  The colors are warm and inviting and the effect of ''washing out'' the detail (no wood on the side of the mill, the grass all blends as one) really works well.', '2004-11-19 06:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021619, 121071, 28261, '<td valign="top">The one focused blade took all the impression out of this for me.  I like the subject very much and was only disappointed by the bold statement in the foreground that clarified the rest of the work instead of mystifying it.</td>', 'The one focused blade took all the impression out of this for me.  I like the subject very much and was only disappointed by the bold statement in the foreground that clarified the rest of the work instead of mystifying it.', '2004-11-19 06:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021637, 120752, 28261, '<td valign="top">The theme here is great and I see that the photo had to be validated, I think it would have been far better without the hand and paint brush.</td>', 'The theme here is great and I see that the photo had to be validated, I think it would have been far better without the hand and paint brush.', '2004-11-19 06:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021642, 120208, 28261, '<td valign="top">I like the pastel and blur here, how did you get the bird so clear while the rest was so ethereal?</td>', 'I like the pastel and blur here, how did you get the bird so clear while the rest was so ethereal?', '2004-11-19 06:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021666, 121137, 28261, '<td valign="top">I thought this was too shiny.</td>', 'I thought this was too shiny.', '2004-11-19 06:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021672, 120987, 28261, '<td valign="top">seems a bit too gray, very nice ripple and blur effect tho.</td>', 'seems a bit too gray, very nice ripple and blur effect tho.', '2004-11-19 07:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021673, 120858, 28261, '<td valign="top">The brige reflection is very nice, but would have tried a blurring or filter of some kind to mute the realness of the leaves.</td>', 'The brige reflection is very nice, but would have tried a blurring or filter of some kind to mute the realness of the leaves.', '2004-11-19 07:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021676, 121324, 28261, '<td valign="top">Did you use a long exposure zooming to achieve this?  The reflections really do a great job of making this looked brushed on as oposed to photo captured.</td>', 'Did you use a long exposure zooming to achieve this?  The reflections really do a great job of making this looked brushed on as oposed to photo captured.', '2004-11-19 07:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021679, 121132, 28261, '<td valign="top">This looks like a Wal-mart premade Christmas tree a bit unfocused.  Seems like it would have been even more effective with even less focus on the ornaments.</td>', 'This looks like a Wal-mart premade Christmas tree a bit unfocused.  Seems like it would have been even more effective with even less focus on the ornaments.', '2004-11-19 07:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021681, 120971, 28261, '<td valign="top">I like the effect of the fog, but the gulls seem too real.  Perhaps less DOF would have pushed this up a bit more.</td>', 'I like the effect of the fog, but the gulls seem too real.  Perhaps less DOF would have pushed this up a bit more.', '2004-11-19 07:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021686, 121186, 28261, '<td valign="top">The black and white of this seems to take something away.  What would it look like if you pushed the WB to a Tungsten (BlueCast) or pushed the saturation/hue into another realm that would have given a pastel coloring to it?</td>', 'The black and white of this seems to take something away.  What would it look like if you pushed the WB to a Tungsten (BlueCast) or pushed the saturation/hue into another realm that would have given a pastel coloring to it?', '2004-11-19 07:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021694, 120552, 28261, '<td valign="top">The specular white on the upper right is a nice background for the end berries, but the far end of the branch still seems too in focus compared to those light areas.</td>', 'The specular white on the upper right is a nice background for the end berries, but the far end of the branch still seems too in focus compared to those light areas.', '2004-11-19 07:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021713, 121426, 21124, '<td valign="top">This is in my opinion a very good photo the perfectly fits the challenge.<br/>To me impressionnism is about depicting light and colors.  In photography (related to impressionism), I think that we should not try to give a "painting effect" but rather focus on transmitting impressions regarding light/colors.<br/> <br/>note: I''d love to see a tutorial on how to achieve such results<br/> <br/> <br/>The soft focus is quite suitable, switching the emphasis to light/color even more.</td>', 'This is in my opinion a very good photo the perfectly fits the challenge.To me impressionnism is about depicting light and colors.  In photography (related to impressionism), I think that we should not try to give a "painting effect" but rather focus on transmitting impressions regarding light/colors. note: I''d love to see a tutorial on how to achieve such results  The soft focus is quite suitable, switching the emphasis to light/color even more.', '2004-11-19 07:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021938, 121071, 3306, '<td valign="top">I really like your choice of subjects and the way you have presented it for this challenge. The DOF and soft lighting beautifully accent the subject.</td>', 'I really like your choice of subjects and the way you have presented it for this challenge. The DOF and soft lighting beautifully accent the subject.', '2004-11-19 10:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021939, 121274, 3306, '<td valign="top">This picture has it all; excellent lighting, colors, texture, DOF, interest, and originality. Great job.</td>', 'This picture has it all; excellent lighting, colors, texture, DOF, interest, and originality. Great job.', '2004-11-19 10:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021945, 121246, 3306, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. You have proved your expertise with the camera in the way you have set up this picture and captured  the moment.</td>', 'Wonderful shot. You have proved your expertise with the camera in the way you have set up this picture and captured  the moment.', '2004-11-19 10:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021989, 121422, 4411, '<td valign="top">A nice photo, gotta love foggy tree shots, though I would likely have cropped out the partial tree on the right. What really kills it is the black speckles all over the faded trees. Not working for me at all I''m afraid.</td>', 'A nice photo, gotta love foggy tree shots, though I would likely have cropped out the partial tree on the right. What really kills it is the black speckles all over the faded trees. Not working for me at all I''m afraid.', '2004-11-19 11:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021996, 120706, 4411, '<td valign="top">Technically good, but the subject doesn''t appeal to me. I guess the main problem is the murky looking water. The water drops on the leaves are very nice though.</td>', 'Technically good, but the subject doesn''t appeal to me. I guess the main problem is the murky looking water. The water drops on the leaves are very nice though.', '2004-11-19 11:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
