(1022702, 120987, 23913, '<td valign="top">IMHO this shot is just a tad to blured,  Impressionism tipicaly still allows u to view an image from a coupple feet back sharp and clear but when u get in close u can see that it is nothing more than well placed patches of colour, and brushstrokes.<br/> <br/>just seems over done to me thats all.</td>', 'IMHO this shot is just a tad to blured,  Impressionism tipicaly still allows u to view an image from a coupple feet back sharp and clear but when u get in close u can see that it is nothing more than well placed patches of colour, and brushstrokes. just seems over done to me thats all.', '2004-11-19 18:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
