(1023151, 121187, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>a very interesting image with good impressionistic feel. The colors are great and the the ambiguity between sky and water works very well. The image speaks well and If I could resolve the mystery created by the walking figure I would feel better. The darkness seem to suggest that the figure is carrying something. bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments:a very interesting image with good impressionistic feel. The colors are great and the the ambiguity between sky and water works very well. The image speaks well and If I could resolve the mystery created by the walking figure I would feel better. The darkness seem to suggest that the figure is carrying something. bumping up.', '2004-11-19 21:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023178, 120971, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>A very nice and serene understatement with soothing tones that enthrall the senses. Impressionistic in its subdued manner but lacking the punch of color.  More like the moon that entices rather then the boldness of the sun. This is not to degrade its pleasant effect. This image has more subtle beauty than those that abound in color. In short, no points deducted while I must admit that I would have liked more color. bumping up<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-26 21:17:22.</i></td>', 'returning for comments:A very nice and serene understatement with soothing tones that enthrall the senses. Impressionistic in its subdued manner but lacking the punch of color.  More like the moon that entices rather then the boldness of the sun. This is not to degrade its pleasant effect. This image has more subtle beauty than those that abound in color. In short, no points deducted while I must admit that I would have liked more color. bumping up', '2004-11-19 21:43:13.000000', '2004-11-26 21:17:22.000000', 1),
(1023187, 121426, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>lovely colors and lovely subdued effect. Indeed a beauty. bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments:lovely colors and lovely subdued effect. Indeed a beauty. bumping up.', '2004-11-19 21:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023191, 121076, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>certainly a beauty and very well done. It creates that overflowing good feel. Bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments:certainly a beauty and very well done. It creates that overflowing good feel. Bumping up.', '2004-11-19 21:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023200, 121343, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>A very different approach lacking the impressionistic purity but a such a strong comp that it brings another element of beauty to this challenge. A lovely execution. Bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments:A very different approach lacking the impressionistic purity but a such a strong comp that it brings another element of beauty to this challenge. A lovely execution. Bumping up.', '2004-11-19 21:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023210, 121324, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>Indeed a beauty with soft flowing hues and silky all around with great wading. A very clever entry. bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments:Indeed a beauty with soft flowing hues and silky all around with great wading. A very clever entry. bumping up.', '2004-11-19 21:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023211, 121274, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>very nice colors and subject matter with great color and that bubbling water. Cool. bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments:very nice colors and subject matter with great color and that bubbling water. Cool. bumping up.', '2004-11-19 21:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023218, 120706, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>Lovely to look at with a great background to showcase the leaves. This is one of those pleasant wall hangers. Bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments:Lovely to look at with a great background to showcase the leaves. This is one of those pleasant wall hangers. Bumping up.', '2004-11-19 21:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023227, 121132, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>While not strictly in the impressionistic spirit, this image presents a unique contribution in the presentation of an idea. No points deducted. Bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments:While not strictly in the impressionistic spirit, this image presents a unique contribution in the presentation of an idea. No points deducted. Bumping up.', '2004-11-19 21:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023235, 121071, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>A beautiful image with softness and wisp of gentle feelings. More impressionistic to the senses rather than the eyes,  but great in its own right. Very good work and bumping up om sheer beauty.</td>', 'returning for comments:A beautiful image with softness and wisp of gentle feelings. More impressionistic to the senses rather than the eyes,  but great in its own right. Very good work and bumping up om sheer beauty.', '2004-11-19 22:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023243, 120176, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>Great silhoutte to cement the impressionistic feel against the lovely moving sky with great colors. There is a diagonal line on right. Bumping up on the fiery contrast which works wonders. <br/></td>', 'returning for comments:Great silhoutte to cement the impressionistic feel against the lovely moving sky with great colors. There is a diagonal line on right. Bumping up on the fiery contrast which works wonders. ', '2004-11-19 22:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023247, 121422, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>A nice effect because it chooses low key colors to create the mood.  A very good composition. bumping up.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-26 21:15:43.</i></td>', 'returning for comments:A nice effect because it chooses low key colors to create the mood.  A very good composition. bumping up.', '2004-11-19 22:08:18.000000', '2004-11-26 21:15:43.000000', 1),
(1023252, 117994, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>Direct and to the point with great color and pleasing execution. certainly an eye catcher. Bumping up</td>', 'returning for comments:Direct and to the point with great color and pleasing execution. certainly an eye catcher. Bumping up', '2004-11-19 22:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023257, 121341, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>A very contemplative image with great composition and overall good weight distribution and the image made etheral with the rays. Bumping up</td>', 'returning for comments:A very contemplative image with great composition and overall good weight distribution and the image made etheral with the rays. Bumping up', '2004-11-19 22:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023360, 120752, 27293, '<td valign="top">Very clever, but composition is somewhat imperfect. I guess again, it''s just me and my personal issues with squares.</td>', 'Very clever, but composition is somewhat imperfect. I guess again, it''s just me and my personal issues with squares.', '2004-11-19 23:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023363, 119970, 27293, '<td valign="top">Not quite Monet, but looks nice. Perhaps if this was done in very subtle pastel tones, as opposed to that in-your-face blue, it would have been a lot more appealing. 8 as it is. Edit: on second thought, a longer exposure time with deeper dof would probably increase the effect, yet make it a little softer, because of more vibrations. I presume this was a hand-held shot.</td>', 'Not quite Monet, but looks nice. Perhaps if this was done in very subtle pastel tones, as opposed to that in-your-face blue, it would have been a lot more appealing. 8 as it is. Edit: on second thought, a longer exposure time with deeper dof would probably increase the effect, yet make it a little softer, because of more vibrations. I presume this was a hand-held shot.', '2004-11-19 23:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023366, 120208, 27293, '<td valign="top">Even if it''s not, it looks photoshopped. All the motion blur lines are just too perfectly straight, for one.</td>', 'Even if it''s not, it looks photoshopped. All the motion blur lines are just too perfectly straight, for one.', '2004-11-19 23:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023368, 121246, 27293, '<td valign="top">This seems like an oversharpened normal long exposure shot. Nice hues and light forms, but i don''t think it associates with impressionism in my mind.</td>', 'This seems like an oversharpened normal long exposure shot. Nice hues and light forms, but i don''t think it associates with impressionism in my mind.', '2004-11-19 23:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023372, 121076, 27293, '<td valign="top">Kinda missing a subject here. And i don''t like the horizon right in the middle. Edit: i take back the statement about a missing subject. Although it would be nice to have something in the front, that''s not the point. But i still insist on the horizon part.</td>', 'Kinda missing a subject here. And i don''t like the horizon right in the middle. Edit: i take back the statement about a missing subject. Although it would be nice to have something in the front, that''s not the point. But i still insist on the horizon part.', '2004-11-19 23:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023376, 121055, 27293, '<td valign="top">Looks photoshopped and as such doesn''t hold interest to me. I''ll come back for a fresh, closer look though. Edit: still think it''s photoshop, all the imperfections are just too perfect.</td>', 'Looks photoshopped and as such doesn''t hold interest to me. I''ll come back for a fresh, closer look though. Edit: still think it''s photoshop, all the imperfections are just too perfect.', '2004-11-19 23:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023378, 121042, 27293, '<td valign="top">I like this, except for composition. The symmetrical division by the middle pine is not very appealing. Edit: also i would flip this horizontally, to make the brighter yellow on the left. Would be slightly more natural.</td>', 'I like this, except for composition. The symmetrical division by the middle pine is not very appealing. Edit: also i would flip this horizontally, to make the brighter yellow on the left. Would be slightly more natural.', '2004-11-19 23:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023389, 121025, 27293, '<td valign="top">Looks photoshopped... I''ll come back for a closer look though. Edit:  I still think this is photoshop, as such it doesn''t hold a whole lot of interest to me. The color noise is just too artificial. I cannot think of anything natural that would give bright cyan noise both on light white, on the fence, etc. I think this is just ''add noise'' feature.</td>', 'Looks photoshopped... I''ll come back for a closer look though. Edit:  I still think this is photoshop, as such it doesn''t hold a whole lot of interest to me. The color noise is just too artificial. I cannot think of anything natural that would give bright cyan noise both on light white, on the fence, etc. I think this is just ''add noise'' feature.', '2004-11-19 23:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023404, 120919, 27293, '<td valign="top">I think this is photoshop from a quick glance, and as such doesn''t hold interest to me. But i will come back for another look. edit: still think it''s photoshop. If it was shot through a think and uneven glass, the glass would need to be almost the size of the truck and too close to the guy to produce this shot. If it''s shot through a car window with a lot of water droplets, the result is just too perfect and uniform for me to believe that is the case. Rain usually produces very uneven droplets, so straight lines, such as the white one at the bottom of the truck wouldn''t have those very uniform disturbances.</td>', 'I think this is photoshop from a quick glance, and as such doesn''t hold interest to me. But i will come back for another look. edit: still think it''s photoshop. If it was shot through a think and uneven glass, the glass would need to be almost the size of the truck and too close to the guy to produce this shot. If it''s shot through a car window with a lot of water droplets, the result is just too perfect and uniform for me to believe that is the case. Rain usually produces very uneven droplets, so straight lines, such as the white one at the bottom of the truck wouldn''t have those very uniform disturbances.', '2004-11-19 23:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023412, 121343, 27293, '<td valign="top">Looks photoshopped and as such doesn''t appeal to me. Nice composition and photo in general if you have a version with soft focus i''d like to take a look. Perhaps it would look slightly more appealing flipped hoizontally too.</td>', 'Looks photoshopped and as such doesn''t appeal to me. Nice composition and photo in general if you have a version with soft focus i''d like to take a look. Perhaps it would look slightly more appealing flipped hoizontally too.', '2004-11-19 23:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023414, 119770, 27293, '<td valign="top">This is truly amazing, period. Nothing to add or subtract. Very smart choice of b/w, the colors would be distracting here.</td>', 'This is truly amazing, period. Nothing to add or subtract. Very smart choice of b/w, the colors would be distracting here.', '2004-11-19 23:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023421, 121137, 27293, '<td valign="top">I like the technique, the composition and the colors. I don''t like the subject and the blown highlights. And i especially like chromatic aberrations. Was that a single element lens?</td>', 'I like the technique, the composition and the colors. I don''t like the subject and the blown highlights. And i especially like chromatic aberrations. Was that a single element lens?', '2004-11-19 23:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023426, 117994, 27293, '<td valign="top">Looks photoshopped. Although the effect may also be digital noise at high ISO. I think this would have done better in B/W and softer focus.</td>', 'Looks photoshopped. Although the effect may also be digital noise at high ISO. I think this would have done better in B/W and softer focus.', '2004-11-19 23:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023433, 121422, 27293, '<td valign="top">Looks photoshopped to me. The eyes are also looking for something right there in the front, but it''s not there, so i get the feeling of incompleteness.</td>', 'Looks photoshopped to me. The eyes are also looking for something right there in the front, but it''s not there, so i get the feeling of incompleteness.', '2004-11-19 23:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023631, 118676, 4805, '<td valign="top">Nice shot John. Good to see a challenge where this stuff is encouraged. This is usually how I experience a band after a few pops...</td>', 'Nice shot John. Good to see a challenge where this stuff is encouraged. This is usually how I experience a band after a few pops...', '2004-11-20 01:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023672, 119970, 14986, '<td valign="top">I just love the colors in this shot.    This is the kind of art I could plan an entire room around.  I''m no expert on impressionism, photography, or art - but I know what I like.   Very nice.</td>', 'I just love the colors in this shot.    This is the kind of art I could plan an entire room around.  I''m no expert on impressionism, photography, or art - but I know what I like.   Very nice.', '2004-11-20 02:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023687, 121076, 22479, '<td valign="top">Truly wonderful composition. I think the title is most fitting. 10+</td>', 'Truly wonderful composition. I think the title is most fitting. 10+', '2004-11-20 03:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023688, 117658, 22479, '<td valign="top">My vote for top 3. I am interested in how the original looked and the post processing you performed to achieve this look. 9</td>', 'My vote for top 3. I am interested in how the original looked and the post processing you performed to achieve this look. 9', '2004-11-20 03:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023691, 120552, 22479, '<td valign="top">Excellent sharpness, detail, and focus. One of my favorites. 8</td>', 'Excellent sharpness, detail, and focus. One of my favorites. 8', '2004-11-20 03:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023692, 121066, 22479, '<td valign="top">This is clearly one of the outstanding entries. I like the colors and detail. I am interested in what the original photograph looked like, and the post processing that was performed to achieve this look. 8</td>', 'This is clearly one of the outstanding entries. I like the colors and detail. I am interested in what the original photograph looked like, and the post processing that was performed to achieve this look. 8', '2004-11-20 03:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023693, 121280, 22479, '<td valign="top">I think this works well for this challenge, but hey, I''m no art critic. :)  One of the strongest entries in my book. Curious how the original appeared and the post processing performed to acheive this look. 8</td>', 'I think this works well for this challenge, but hey, I''m no art critic. :)  One of the strongest entries in my book. Curious how the original appeared and the post processing performed to acheive this look. 8', '2004-11-20 03:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023694, 121187, 22479, '<td valign="top">One of the stronger entries. I like the overall look of this piece. The reflections add a lot of character. 7</td>', 'One of the stronger entries. I like the overall look of this piece. The reflections add a lot of character. 7', '2004-11-20 03:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023695, 119970, 22479, '<td valign="top">Definitely one of the stronger entries of the bunch. I think the colors are fantastic and the overall composition has a lot of depth. 7</td>', 'Definitely one of the stronger entries of the bunch. I think the colors are fantastic and the overall composition has a lot of depth. 7', '2004-11-20 03:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023696, 117435, 22479, '<td valign="top">I think this is definintely one of the stronger and more distinctive entries. I like the soft colors and the blur. 7</td>', 'I think this is definintely one of the stronger and more distinctive entries. I like the soft colors and the blur. 7', '2004-11-20 03:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023697, 120752, 22479, '<td valign="top">Very unique. I think this is one of the stronger entries and should do well.</td>', 'Very unique. I think this is one of the stronger entries and should do well.', '2004-11-20 03:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023699, 121324, 22479, '<td valign="top">Ah the requisite duck, ever omnipresent in most challenges. Your artistic spin works very well and gives this a dreamy look. One of the stronger entries in this challenge for sure, and should do well.</td>', 'Ah the requisite duck, ever omnipresent in most challenges. Your artistic spin works very well and gives this a dreamy look. One of the stronger entries in this challenge for sure, and should do well.', '2004-11-20 03:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023700, 121042, 22479, '<td valign="top">Your artistic creation fits the challenge theme very well, in my unqualified opinion. I think this is definitely one of the stronger entries and should do qute well.</td>', 'Your artistic creation fits the challenge theme very well, in my unqualified opinion. I think this is definitely one of the stronger entries and should do qute well.', '2004-11-20 03:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023701, 120512, 22479, '<td valign="top">Your artistic take on this piece works quite well, in my unqualified opinion. I like the framing, contrast, and subdued tones. Overall clearly one of the strongest entries and I imagine this should do quite well. 7</td>', 'Your artistic take on this piece works quite well, in my unqualified opinion. I like the framing, contrast, and subdued tones. Overall clearly one of the strongest entries and I imagine this should do quite well. 7', '2004-11-20 03:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023702, 120971, 22479, '<td valign="top">You captured a very nice mood. I can smell the morning dew from here haha. I think this is one of the stronger entries and imagine it will do very well.</td>', 'You captured a very nice mood. I can smell the morning dew from here haha. I think this is one of the stronger entries and imagine it will do very well.', '2004-11-20 03:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023704, 120706, 22479, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful, and I like the soft tones contrasting with the drops of water. I think it''s one of the stronger entries and imagine it should perform well.</td>', 'This is wonderful, and I like the soft tones contrasting with the drops of water. I think it''s one of the stronger entries and imagine it should perform well.', '2004-11-20 03:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023706, 121025, 22479, '<td valign="top">Not sure if the noise was intentionally introduced, but it detracts from a magnificent scene. I would rank this higher if the noise was better handled.</td>', 'Not sure if the noise was intentionally introduced, but it detracts from a magnificent scene. I would rank this higher if the noise was better handled.', '2004-11-20 03:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023711, 121422, 22479, '<td valign="top">I think you had a very good photograph to work with. I am not fond of the posterized effect, however. I would have rated this higher if you had approached this from a different angle.</td>', 'I think you had a very good photograph to work with. I am not fond of the posterized effect, however. I would have rated this higher if you had approached this from a different angle.', '2004-11-20 03:27:43.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1023712, 119770, 22479, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure if a B&amp;W entry is ideal for this particular challenge. Be that as it may, I think your post processing works well to create a distinctive artsy look.<br/></td>', 'Not quite sure if a B&W entry is ideal for this particular challenge. Be that as it may, I think your post processing works well to create a distinctive artsy look.', '2004-11-20 03:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023713, 121188, 22479, '<td valign="top">I think your original photograph must have been quite spectacular. I am not fond of the posterized look...I would rate this higher if you had approached the post processing from a different angle.</td>', 'I think your original photograph must have been quite spectacular. I am not fond of the posterized look...I would rate this higher if you had approached the post processing from a different angle.', '2004-11-20 03:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023893, 120971, 4411, '<td valign="top">Gotta love foggy tree shots. Personally I would have cropped a chunk off the top, and probably cloned the gulls(?) out. Seems to be suffering from some fairly heavy jpeg banding too :(</td>', 'Gotta love foggy tree shots. Personally I would have cropped a chunk off the top, and probably cloned the gulls(?) out. Seems to be suffering from some fairly heavy jpeg banding too :(', '2004-11-20 08:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024045, 120512, 4411, '<td valign="top">Well composed, and the colours are great. A little dark at the bottom maybe.<br/>I''m not convinced this is the best subject for this softening effect though, I think I''d prefer to see tall the detail nice and sharp.</td>', 'Well composed, and the colours are great. A little dark at the bottom maybe.I''m not convinced this is the best subject for this softening effect though, I think I''d prefer to see tall the detail nice and sharp.', '2004-11-20 11:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024056, 120752, 4411, '<td valign="top">The painting is fantastic. I''d like to see it in full after the challenge.<br/>I''m not over keen on the photo though - technically it is good, but nothing else really appeals to me.</td>', 'The painting is fantastic. I''d like to see it in full after the challenge.I''m not over keen on the photo though - technically it is good, but nothing else really appeals to me.', '2004-11-20 11:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024064, 120987, 4411, '<td valign="top">Took me a while to realise that this wasn''t a blurred random reflection! When the flag ''appeared'' it made a whole lot more sense. A bright blue sky would have been nice as it seems a little flat to me as it is. I do tend to prefer very colourful photos though.</td>', 'Took me a while to realise that this wasn''t a blurred random reflection! When the flag ''appeared'' it made a whole lot more sense. A bright blue sky would have been nice as it seems a little flat to me as it is. I do tend to prefer very colourful photos though.', '2004-11-20 11:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024072, 121274, 4411, '<td valign="top">A very modern looking take on the challenge. I like the colours, and the water looks like some nasty chemical mixture. Composition is also good. The only part I don''t like is the ghostly looking spurt of water in the middle of the tiles.</td>', 'A very modern looking take on the challenge. I like the colours, and the water looks like some nasty chemical mixture. Composition is also good. The only part I don''t like is the ghostly looking spurt of water in the middle of the tiles.', '2004-11-20 11:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024093, 121076, 4411, '<td valign="top">Very similar to a lot of the shots I took for this challenge! Unfotunately I rejected them due to the lack of any kind of focal point, and this suffers the same problem (though yours is better because at least there''s something in the foreground).<br/>A nice enough shot, with great colours, but nothing that leaps out at me.</td>', 'Very similar to a lot of the shots I took for this challenge! Unfotunately I rejected them due to the lack of any kind of focal point, and this suffers the same problem (though yours is better because at least there''s something in the foreground).A nice enough shot, with great colours, but nothing that leaps out at me.', '2004-11-20 11:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024109, 120858, 4411, '<td valign="top">This is great. The bridge at the top is very subtle and very effective. I like the way the shot is faded/washed out towards the top too.</td>', 'This is great. The bridge at the top is very subtle and very effective. I like the way the shot is faded/washed out towards the top too.', '2004-11-20 11:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024411, 121076, 24976, '<td valign="top">excellent work, really looks like a painting</td>', 'excellent work, really looks like a painting', '2004-11-20 16:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024415, 121186, 24976, '<td valign="top">beatiful image, but the title is not very fitting imo and im not holding it against you. <br/>9</td>', 'beatiful image, but the title is not very fitting imo and im not holding it against you. 9', '2004-11-20 16:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024419, 120176, 24976, '<td valign="top">this is really random but impressionist, and monet in particular didnt use black...</td>', 'this is really random but impressionist, and monet in particular didnt use black...', '2004-11-20 16:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024422, 121426, 24976, '<td valign="top">one of my favourites in the challenge</td>', 'one of my favourites in the challenge', '2004-11-20 16:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024423, 120548, 24976, '<td valign="top">makes me dizzy :-(</td>', 'makes me dizzy :-(', '2004-11-20 16:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024434, 120919, 15011, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2004-11-20 16:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024441, 121137, 28858, '<td valign="top">Brilliantly Done</td>', 'Brilliantly Done', '2004-11-20 16:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024481, 121426, 4411, '<td valign="top">Nice, but it all sorta blurs into one. Could do with some more separation between the subject and the background in some way. Superb colour though.</td>', 'Nice, but it all sorta blurs into one. Could do with some more separation between the subject and the background in some way. Superb colour though.', '2004-11-20 17:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024484, 121246, 4411, '<td valign="top">Great long exposure. Really shows all the different paths that the water takes. I could stare at this for ages and bet the full size image is killer.</td>', 'Great long exposure. Really shows all the different paths that the water takes. I could stare at this for ages and bet the full size image is killer.', '2004-11-20 17:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024488, 121042, 4411, '<td valign="top">This is excellent. Really looks painted, and there''s so many colours in there. Top stuff.</td>', 'This is excellent. Really looks painted, and there''s so many colours in there. Top stuff.', '2004-11-20 17:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
