(1025065, 121186, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>Now, here you have a beautiful image which you have placed at a great disatvantage. Impressionism was born out the color medium. There were always great pencil and ink renditions in varied styles but not one of them were recovered or regrouped with this movement. It is the color that trumps form in this genre. This being so delicate, I would venture it would scored much higher in its color rendition. Please do not hate my assessment. I realize that one can reproduce any of the giant''s of impressionism into black and white prints and while many will look good, they are certainly not well served. Your composition and rendition is certainly above average and I am sure you will finish is a respectable placing, but the color may have placed this right at the very top. Bumping to 7<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-26 21:14:02.</i></td>', 'returning for comments:Now, here you have a beautiful image which you have placed at a great disatvantage. Impressionism was born out the color medium. There were always great pencil and ink renditions in varied styles but not one of them were recovered or regrouped with this movement. It is the color that trumps form in this genre. This being so delicate, I would venture it would scored much higher in its color rendition. Please do not hate my assessment. I realize that one can reproduce any of the giant''s of impressionism into black and white prints and while many will look good, they are certainly not well served. Your composition and rendition is certainly above average and I am sure you will finish is a respectable placing, but the color may have placed this right at the very top. Bumping to 7', '2004-11-21 01:12:19.000000', '2004-11-26 21:14:02.000000', 1),
(1025066, 121280, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments.<br/>On second reflection, this image is haunting and I am returning to bump again.Cool image and cool effect. I love it.  The type which is expected to score very high. Bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments.On second reflection, this image is haunting and I am returning to bump again.Cool image and cool effect. I love it.  The type which is expected to score very high. Bumping up.', '2004-11-21 01:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
