(1025241, 120752, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Invitational Challenge</b> <i>Level: Experienced</i> <br/> <br/><b>Challenge link</b>: strong - if a little tacky.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: well conceived and executed. Photo does look a bit ''ordinary'' though - can''t quite put my finger on it. Technically good shot and you''ve thought it through well.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: I''m sure they''ll be plenty, but I don''t need to come back to this one really.<br/> <br/><b>Score</b>: 7</td>', 'Invitational Challenge Level: Experienced  Challenge link: strong - if a little tacky. Image critique: well conceived and executed. Photo does look a bit ''ordinary'' though - can''t quite put my finger on it. Technically good shot and you''ve thought it through well. Out-of-challenge appeal: I''m sure they''ll be plenty, but I don''t need to come back to this one really. Score: 7', '2004-11-21 07:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1025244, 121132, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Invitational Challenge</b> <i>Level: Experienced</i> <br/> <br/><b>Challenge link</b>: weak-medium. It does seem to have largely missed the brief.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: A sweet scene with much Christmas spirit, nicely composed with some good detail and appropriate treatment.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: not much for me.<br/> <br/><b>Score</b>: 4</td>', 'Invitational Challenge Level: Experienced  Challenge link: weak-medium. It does seem to have largely missed the brief. Image critique: A sweet scene with much Christmas spirit, nicely composed with some good detail and appropriate treatment. Out-of-challenge appeal: not much for me. Score: 4', '2004-11-21 07:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1025245, 121274, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Invitational Challenge</b> <i>Level: Experienced</i> <br/> <br/><b>Challenge link</b>: weak - medium. Due to filtered FX this shot no longer holds enough photographic integrity to prove its impressionistic quality. Image has been too heavily enhanced in post-processing.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: a good composition but very little to retain interest.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: not much, other than to see whose this is!<br/> <br/><b>Score</b>: 4</td>', 'Invitational Challenge Level: Experienced  Challenge link: weak - medium. Due to filtered FX this shot no longer holds enough photographic integrity to prove its impressionistic quality. Image has been too heavily enhanced in post-processing. Image critique: a good composition but very little to retain interest. Out-of-challenge appeal: not much, other than to see whose this is! Score: 4', '2004-11-21 07:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1025246, 121426, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Invitational Challenge</b> <i>Level: Experienced</i> <br/> <br/><b>Challenge link</b>: weak. Possibly missed the point of the challenge - there''s no impressionism here.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: very pretty little shot with nice detail. Background is distracting though due to the dark mark which is very prominent. Good composition otherwise.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: OK - but not much to come back for really.<br/> <br/><b>Score</b>: 4</td>', 'Invitational Challenge Level: Experienced  Challenge link: weak. Possibly missed the point of the challenge - there''s no impressionism here. Image critique: very pretty little shot with nice detail. Background is distracting though due to the dark mark which is very prominent. Good composition otherwise. Out-of-challenge appeal: OK - but not much to come back for really. Score: 4', '2004-11-21 07:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1025247, 121025, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Invitational Challenge</b> <i>Level: Experienced</i> <br/> <br/><b>Challenge link</b>: weak - although you have depicted an Impressionist style.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: Scene is OK, but it''s important to grasp what the challenge is about. This is not photographic impressionism but filtered digital art and you''ve clearly misunderstood the aim here.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: none for me, as the FX are crude and reminiscent of some initial experiments with Photoshop.<br/> <br/><b>Score</b>: 3</td>', 'Invitational Challenge Level: Experienced  Challenge link: weak - although you have depicted an Impressionist style. Image critique: Scene is OK, but it''s important to grasp what the challenge is about. This is not photographic impressionism but filtered digital art and you''ve clearly misunderstood the aim here. Out-of-challenge appeal: none for me, as the FX are crude and reminiscent of some initial experiments with Photoshop. Score: 3', '2004-11-21 07:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
