(1025850, 117658, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Invitational Challenge</b> <i>Level: Experienced</i> <br/> <br/><b>Challenge link</b>: medium, but more digital in its appearance than photographic. While I like the effect, it is an emulation of a painting style than a photographic representation of the subject through impressionistic technique (composition and subject).<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: a good exposure and nice lighting, but difficult to assess since much of the integrity has been losty through the filtered effects and it seems that, to a large extent, you''ve missed the point here.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: it''s a sumptous, Christmasy vibe, but there''s not much interest for me to revisit frequently.<br/> <br/><b>Score</b>: 6</td>', 'Invitational Challenge Level: Experienced  Challenge link: medium, but more digital in its appearance than photographic. While I like the effect, it is an emulation of a painting style than a photographic representation of the subject through impressionistic technique (composition and subject). Image critique: a good exposure and nice lighting, but difficult to assess since much of the integrity has been losty through the filtered effects and it seems that, to a large extent, you''ve missed the point here. Out-of-challenge appeal: it''s a sumptous, Christmasy vibe, but there''s not much interest for me to revisit frequently. Score: 6', '2004-11-21 18:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1025895, 121076, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Invitational Challenge</b> <i>Level: Experienced</i> <br/> <br/><b>Challenge link</b>: very strong and my tip for a ribbon - probably blue.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: the painterly feel of this is very tangible and as such makes for a beautiful artistic approach without complete sacrifice of the original photo. The escence of the scene in reality is still ever-present, further enhanced by your sensitive post-processing.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: total - will revisit for sure.<br/> <br/><b>Score</b>: 10</td>', 'Invitational Challenge Level: Experienced  Challenge link: very strong and my tip for a ribbon - probably blue. Image critique: the painterly feel of this is very tangible and as such makes for a beautiful artistic approach without complete sacrifice of the original photo. The escence of the scene in reality is still ever-present, further enhanced by your sensitive post-processing. Out-of-challenge appeal: total - will revisit for sure. Score: 10', '2004-11-21 18:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1025896, 119770, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Invitational Challenge</b> <i>Level: Experienced</i> <br/> <br/><b>Challenge link</b>: very strong - a great interpretation both as a concept and execution.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: just a lovely, creative notion, nicely treated and ambiguous.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: I love it, so will enjoy revisiting this image.<br/> <br/><b>Score</b>: 8</td>', 'Invitational Challenge Level: Experienced  Challenge link: very strong - a great interpretation both as a concept and execution. Image critique: just a lovely, creative notion, nicely treated and ambiguous. Out-of-challenge appeal: I love it, so will enjoy revisiting this image. Score: 8', '2004-11-21 18:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
