(1025902, 120548, 489, '<td valign="top">Very creative approach to this challenge. I will definitely be experimenting with the strobe feature of my flash after seeing this.</td>', 'Very creative approach to this challenge. I will definitely be experimenting with the strobe feature of my flash after seeing this.', '2004-11-21 18:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1025906, 120706, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Invitational Challenge</b> <i>Level: Experienced</i> <br/> <br/><b>Challenge link</b>: weak. The impressionistic theme is not very apparent here.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: it''s a soothing subject with subdued colours, well shot - but lacking that vital focal point to draw in a viewer.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: not much reason to come back to this really.<br/> <br/><b>Score</b>: 4</td>', 'Invitational Challenge Level: Experienced  Challenge link: weak. The impressionistic theme is not very apparent here. Image critique: it''s a soothing subject with subdued colours, well shot - but lacking that vital focal point to draw in a viewer. Out-of-challenge appeal: not much reason to come back to this really. Score: 4', '2004-11-21 19:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1025915, 121280, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Invitational Challenge</b> <i>Level: Experienced</i> <br/> <br/><b>Challenge link</b>: strong.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: painterly treatment appears to override the actual impressionistic quality in the photo, but this is a good use of technique for the subject. It''s emotive and well composed - if a little too processed for my preference. Blue looks a little too pushed and comes forward in the shot too far, when really a more subdued hue would leave the key subject in the spotlght (so to speak).<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: it''s interesting so I will revisit.<br/> <br/><b>Score</b>: 7</td>', 'Invitational Challenge Level: Experienced  Challenge link: strong. Image critique: painterly treatment appears to override the actual impressionistic quality in the photo, but this is a good use of technique for the subject. It''s emotive and well composed - if a little too processed for my preference. Blue looks a little too pushed and comes forward in the shot too far, when really a more subdued hue would leave the key subject in the spotlght (so to speak). Out-of-challenge appeal: it''s interesting so I will revisit. Score: 7', '2004-11-21 19:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1025918, 121187, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Invitational Challenge</b> <i>Level: Experienced</i> <br/> <br/><b>Challenge link</b>: total. Perfect assessment of the brief and exercises many facets of the challenge.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: excellent in all respects. Great choice of focus and composition is clearly sound. I do wonder what it would look like in mono too - even more illusive I should imagine. If anything this is one shot that may have benefited from a border, as the colours wash out a bit next to the DPC grey.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: I''ll definitely revisit this one and I''m sure many others will appreciate it.</td>', 'Invitational Challenge Level: Experienced  Challenge link: total. Perfect assessment of the brief and exercises many facets of the challenge. Image critique: excellent in all respects. Great choice of focus and composition is clearly sound. I do wonder what it would look like in mono too - even more illusive I should imagine. If anything this is one shot that may have benefited from a border, as the colours wash out a bit next to the DPC grey. Out-of-challenge appeal: I''ll definitely revisit this one and I''m sure many others will appreciate it.', '2004-11-21 19:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1025924, 120971, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Invitational Challenge</b> <i>Level: Experienced</i> <br/> <br/><b>Challenge link</b>: strong.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: the silence is tangible. A visually cleansing, non-literal approach which delivers an ordinary scene made special.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: total - will revisit for sure.<br/> <br/><b>Score</b>: 8</td>', 'Invitational Challenge Level: Experienced  Challenge link: strong. Image critique: the silence is tangible. A visually cleansing, non-literal approach which delivers an ordinary scene made special. Out-of-challenge appeal: total - will revisit for sure. Score: 8', '2004-11-21 19:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1025935, 120712, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Invitational Challenge</b> <i>Level: Experienced</i> <br/> <br/><b>Challenge link</b>: medium.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: while this scene is now an impression of the subject, it can only really be said that it is such due solely to camera shake! For me it requires a degree more depth and compositional planning to deliver the feeling of impressionism than simply distorting the scene.<br/> <br/>Colours are pleasant but the feeling of blur just overpowers the emotive nature of the photo.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: not a great deal due to the technique whcih has been applied only for meeting this challenge.<br/> <br/><b>Score</b>: 4</td>', 'Invitational Challenge Level: Experienced  Challenge link: medium. Image critique: while this scene is now an impression of the subject, it can only really be said that it is such due solely to camera shake! For me it requires a degree more depth and compositional planning to deliver the feeling of impressionism than simply distorting the scene. Colours are pleasant but the feeling of blur just overpowers the emotive nature of the photo. Out-of-challenge appeal: not a great deal due to the technique whcih has been applied only for meeting this challenge. Score: 4', '2004-11-21 19:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1025939, 121324, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Invitational Challenge</b> <i>Level: Experienced</i> <br/> <br/><b>Challenge link</b>: strong<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: appropriate subject for the technique. Strong, emotive colour and not too blatant post-processing. Nice composition.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: yes - I like it.<br/> <br/><b>Score</b>: 7</td>', 'Invitational Challenge Level: Experienced  Challenge link: strong Image critique: appropriate subject for the technique. Strong, emotive colour and not too blatant post-processing. Nice composition. Out-of-challenge appeal: yes - I like it. Score: 7', '2004-11-21 19:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1025947, 120987, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Invitational Challenge</b> <i>Level: Experienced</i> <br/> <br/><b>Challenge link</b>: strong.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: it exercises the correct approach for this challenge in my view, but, for want of a better word, it''s a bit dull. Colour is just too washed out and the subject not exactly riveting. However, you have attempted impressionism through your photo and not a filter or ''artificial'' means so you deserve credit for that.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: it''s OK but not much to return for.<br/> <br/><b>Score</b>: 6</td>', 'Invitational Challenge Level: Experienced  Challenge link: strong. Image critique: it exercises the correct approach for this challenge in my view, but, for want of a better word, it''s a bit dull. Colour is just too washed out and the subject not exactly riveting. However, you have attempted impressionism through your photo and not a filter or ''artificial'' means so you deserve credit for that. Out-of-challenge appeal: it''s OK but not much to return for. Score: 6', '2004-11-21 19:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1025951, 120548, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Invitational Challenge</b> <i>Level: Experienced</i> <br/> <br/><b>Challenge link</b>: strong.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: well it''s impressionism - but dizzying! Whether the subject is appropriate? I don''t hink so - it seems that anything would do just to use this technique, so therefore it''s gratuitous without much purpose. Strong colour, crop is a bit tight at the bottom.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: yeah - I quite like this.<br/> <br/><b>Score</b>: 7</td>', 'Invitational Challenge Level: Experienced  Challenge link: strong. Image critique: well it''s impressionism - but dizzying! Whether the subject is appropriate? I don''t hink so - it seems that anything would do just to use this technique, so therefore it''s gratuitous without much purpose. Strong colour, crop is a bit tight at the bottom. Out-of-challenge appeal: yeah - I quite like this. Score: 7', '2004-11-21 19:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1025952, 119385, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Invitational Challenge</b> <i>Level: Experienced</i> <br/> <br/><b>Challenge link</b>: strong. You''ve understood the brief.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: attractive composition and pleasant subject. It looks a little washed out in places, but it''s a nice approach.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: medium - I''d probably look at this once again.<br/> <br/><b>Score</b>: 7</td>', 'Invitational Challenge Level: Experienced  Challenge link: strong. You''ve understood the brief. Image critique: attractive composition and pleasant subject. It looks a little washed out in places, but it''s a nice approach. Out-of-challenge appeal: medium - I''d probably look at this once again. Score: 7', '2004-11-21 19:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1025956, 120208, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Invitational Challenge</b> <i>Level: Experienced</i> <br/> <br/><b>Challenge link</b>: medium/strong. <br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: Lovely composition and pose (she looks lovely too) but this does <i>seem</i> to be artificially blurred which looks a little obvious in places. Your saviour though is the compo and subject - both very strong.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: nice pose and photo underneath blur. Like it.<br/> <br/><b>Score</b>: 7</td>', 'Invitational Challenge Level: Experienced  Challenge link: medium/strong.  Image critique: Lovely composition and pose (she looks lovely too) but this does seem to be artificially blurred which looks a little obvious in places. Your saviour though is the compo and subject - both very strong. Out-of-challenge appeal: nice pose and photo underneath blur. Like it. Score: 7', '2004-11-21 19:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
