(1026093, 121280, 17203, '<td valign="top">This is just fabulous! Wonderful colors, composition and emotion, with just enough focus to capture the moment. My pick for blue- hope to see you there! 10</td>', 'This is just fabulous! Wonderful colors, composition and emotion, with just enough focus to capture the moment. My pick for blue- hope to see you there! 10', '2004-11-21 21:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
