(1026101, 119970, 17203, '<td valign="top">Though I''m not a huge fan of the motion blur approach, you found the ideal subject and the colors are perfect. I think with a different approach to the impressionism aspect (a shallower DOF with a very slight motion blur, or shooting through mottled glass, for example), this shot would have dominated the challenge. It still might... one of my top three picks! 9</td>', 'Though I''m not a huge fan of the motion blur approach, you found the ideal subject and the colors are perfect. I think with a different approach to the impressionism aspect (a shallower DOF with a very slight motion blur, or shooting through mottled glass, for example), this shot would have dominated the challenge. It still might... one of my top three picks! 9', '2004-11-21 21:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026104, 121025, 10686, '<td valign="top">Some areas of the image work well with your effect, others are not so good.</td>', 'Some areas of the image work well with your effect, others are not so good.', '2004-11-21 21:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026106, 121188, 10686, '<td valign="top">very smooth and almost plastic</td>', 'very smooth and almost plastic', '2004-11-21 21:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026109, 121066, 10686, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really say "Impressionism" to me, rather it seems to suggest something much more modern. I do like this shot.</td>', 'Doesn''t really say "Impressionism" to me, rather it seems to suggest something much more modern. I do like this shot.', '2004-11-21 21:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026115, 120706, 17203, '<td valign="top">One of the few "in focus" images that I feel makes a strong connection with impressionism, and I don''t know exactly why. Of course, the subject matter is excellent, the composition and muted colors are great, and the focus is juuuuust soft enough to suggest impressionism. The pale squiggly lines under the water are annoying, but I expect to see this in the top 5... maybe a ribbon. Good luck! 9</td>', 'One of the few "in focus" images that I feel makes a strong connection with impressionism, and I don''t know exactly why. Of course, the subject matter is excellent, the composition and muted colors are great, and the focus is juuuuust soft enough to suggest impressionism. The pale squiggly lines under the water are annoying, but I expect to see this in the top 5... maybe a ribbon. Good luck! 9', '2004-11-21 21:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026117, 121132, 10686, '<td valign="top">This says more "soft focus" to me than "Impressionism" It''s not a bad shot, just doesn''t really say Impressionism to me.</td>', 'This says more "soft focus" to me than "Impressionism" It''s not a bad shot, just doesn''t really say Impressionism to me.', '2004-11-21 21:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026119, 120752, 10686, '<td valign="top">Cool idea</td>', 'Cool idea', '2004-11-21 21:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026140, 117658, 16301, '<td valign="top">Great composition, I like the inclusion of the candle. The colors are nice, I like how you managed to make it look like a painting. Good luck...</td>', 'Great composition, I like the inclusion of the candle. The colors are nice, I like how you managed to make it look like a painting. Good luck...', '2004-11-21 21:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026141, 120208, 17203, '<td valign="top">I have to compete with THIS?!? I dunno if it''s <i>impressionism</i>, but it''s freakin'' gorgeous. There''s a little too much detail to match my admittedly novice understanding of impressionism, but the colors and composition are great. Should make the top 5 easily, if not ribbon.</td>', 'I have to compete with THIS?!? I dunno if it''s impressionism, but it''s freakin'' gorgeous. There''s a little too much detail to match my admittedly novice understanding of impressionism, but the colors and composition are great. Should make the top 5 easily, if not ribbon.', '2004-11-21 21:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026147, 121187, 16301, '<td valign="top">Great composition, very painterly look to it...</td>', 'Great composition, very painterly look to it...', '2004-11-21 21:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
