(1026164, 120919, 16301, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea! I like the composition and colors. Try selling it to Coca-Cola :)</td>', 'Very nice idea! I like the composition and colors. Try selling it to Coca-Cola :)', '2004-11-21 21:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026166, 118676, 10686, '<td valign="top">Reminds me more of DuChamp''s "Nude Descending a Staircase" than any Impressionist work. Don''t get me wrong, I like this, but it just doesn''t say anything Impressionistic to me. The motion blur here conveys an idea of fluid motion, a series of moments captured in one frame, rather than the deconstruction of a moment of light into fragments of color.</td>', 'Reminds me more of DuChamp''s "Nude Descending a Staircase" than any Impressionist work. Don''t get me wrong, I like this, but it just doesn''t say anything Impressionistic to me. The motion blur here conveys an idea of fluid motion, a series of moments captured in one frame, rather than the deconstruction of a moment of light into fragments of color.', '2004-11-21 21:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026198, 121343, 20889, '<td valign="top">This is quiet a bit different from all the rest, I see. Bumping up</td>', 'This is quiet a bit different from all the rest, I see. Bumping up', '2004-11-21 22:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026205, 121055, 20889, '<td valign="top">The only thing I see might be, the back side of the fence could be a bit darker. Since it is in the shadows.  But the more I look at it. I think a ten is in order.</td>', 'The only thing I see might be, the back side of the fence could be a bit darker. Since it is in the shadows.  But the more I look at it. I think a ten is in order.', '2004-11-21 22:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026215, 120858, 20889, '<td valign="top">I had first gave you a 5, I like the whole sceen, but what ever that is in the top left corner is. It just very distracting.</td>', 'I had first gave you a 5, I like the whole sceen, but what ever that is in the top left corner is. It just very distracting.', '2004-11-21 22:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026238, 121280, 5286, '<td valign="top">now this looks like impressionism to me :) . 10.</td>', 'now this looks like impressionism to me :) . 10.', '2004-11-21 22:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026242, 119970, 5286, '<td valign="top">wow. inspired from  Monet''s water lilies, i guess? lovely effect.</td>', 'wow. inspired from  Monet''s water lilies, i guess? lovely effect.', '2004-11-21 22:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026268, 117658, 17203, '<td valign="top">A terrific example of impressionism- one of my top 5. The streaks of light above the candle make it obvious that this is no mere PS effect. Looks like something placed on or in front of the lens to create a realistic, painterly look. I''ll be interested to see how it was done. Good job! 9</td>', 'A terrific example of impressionism- one of my top 5. The streaks of light above the candle make it obvious that this is no mere PS effect. Looks like something placed on or in front of the lens to create a realistic, painterly look. I''ll be interested to see how it was done. Good job! 9', '2004-11-21 22:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026275, 120752, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>A unique approach to both worlds. Here you have made a sandwich of an impressionism sliver between two slices of classical realism. Good work. Bumping up. And rebumping.</td>', 'returning for comments:A unique approach to both worlds. Here you have made a sandwich of an impressionism sliver between two slices of classical realism. Good work. Bumping up. And rebumping.', '2004-11-21 22:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026279, 121132, 17203, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. I want to score it high, but I don''t personally think of soft focus alone as impressionism. I mean, the colors and composition are excellent, but it''s practically a traditional photograph. Very daring of you to use such a bold border! 6</td>', 'Beautiful image. I want to score it high, but I don''t personally think of soft focus alone as impressionism. I mean, the colors and composition are excellent, but it''s practically a traditional photograph. Very daring of you to use such a bold border! 6', '2004-11-21 23:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026313, 121076, 17203, '<td valign="top">Great job meeting the challenge with this one- it DOES look like an impressionist (or maybe watercolor) painting, though a little somber. I wish the colors had been a touch brighter. Still one of the strongest entries. 8</td>', 'Great job meeting the challenge with this one- it DOES look like an impressionist (or maybe watercolor) painting, though a little somber. I wish the colors had been a touch brighter. Still one of the strongest entries. 8', '2004-11-21 23:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026328, 121055, 17203, '<td valign="top">Beautiful- and very believable as impressionism. There is no attempt to disguise an apparent filter effect put to good use. While so many filters look like an afterthought, this is an image that probably looks MUCH better filtered than it did as a straight photo. My only nitpick is that the white sky distracts from the warm colors pervasive in the rest of the image- I''d crop more off the top. Otherwise, well done! 8</td>', 'Beautiful- and very believable as impressionism. There is no attempt to disguise an apparent filter effect put to good use. While so many filters look like an afterthought, this is an image that probably looks MUCH better filtered than it did as a straight photo. My only nitpick is that the white sky distracts from the warm colors pervasive in the rest of the image- I''d crop more off the top. Otherwise, well done! 8', '2004-11-21 23:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026329, 121246, 9668, '<td valign="top">This is and awsome shot! I love this! Wow.</td>', 'This is and awsome shot! I love this! Wow.', '2004-11-21 23:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026343, 120548, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good color, and a very creative approach, but I''m not entirely sold on this look as impressionism. I think it''s because of all the sharp little details visible with each flash. This might sound weird, but on my screen it looks like cropping down to only the bottom right corner (just the pot and background) would be a better representation of the soft style of impressionism I envision.</td>', 'Good color, and a very creative approach, but I''m not entirely sold on this look as impressionism. I think it''s because of all the sharp little details visible with each flash. This might sound weird, but on my screen it looks like cropping down to only the bottom right corner (just the pot and background) would be a better representation of the soft style of impressionism I envision.', '2004-11-21 23:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026348, 117658, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is representative of what I think of when I think of impressionist paintings.  I bumped this up to 10 earlier in the week and forgot to leave a comment.  Thanks for sharing this.</td>', 'This is representative of what I think of when I think of impressionist paintings.  I bumped this up to 10 earlier in the week and forgot to leave a comment.  Thanks for sharing this.', '2004-11-21 23:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026352, 121188, 15920, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  Not exactly what I think of as "impressionist" but I liked it, and gave it a 10.  I especially like the fact that the sunrise (or set) is peaking out from behind the building.</td>', 'Very nicely done.  Not exactly what I think of as "impressionist" but I liked it, and gave it a 10.  I especially like the fact that the sunrise (or set) is peaking out from behind the building.', '2004-11-21 23:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026355, 120512, 15920, '<td valign="top">This was one of two entries that didn''t fit what I thought of as "impressionist" but really liked.  I gave it a 10.  The lighting on the original image must have been great.</td>', 'This was one of two entries that didn''t fit what I thought of as "impressionist" but really liked.  I gave it a 10.  The lighting on the original image must have been great.', '2004-11-21 23:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026356, 120752, 9906, '<td valign="top">This has got to be the best IMHO!  Love how you managed to combine the impressionistic and the photographic without losing the integrity of either!  Had to come back to this shot and bump it up (which I hardly ever do.  Sometimes down but hardly ever up.)  Oh and I just realized another reason I like it....  It kinda has a Norman Rockwell feel to it!  Kudos and crossing fingers on a ribbon for this one!<br/>TC</td>', 'This has got to be the best IMHO!  Love how you managed to combine the impressionistic and the photographic without losing the integrity of either!  Had to come back to this shot and bump it up (which I hardly ever do.  Sometimes down but hardly ever up.)  Oh and I just realized another reason I like it....  It kinda has a Norman Rockwell feel to it!  Kudos and crossing fingers on a ribbon for this one!TC', '2004-11-21 23:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026358, 121076, 15920, '<td valign="top">Simple, clear, and well done.  This was a 10 from me.</td>', 'Simple, clear, and well done.  This was a 10 from me.', '2004-11-21 23:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026362, 120752, 15920, '<td valign="top">I thought this was the most clever image in the competition.  Very well done.  10 from me.</td>', 'I thought this was the most clever image in the competition.  Very well done.  10 from me.', '2004-11-21 23:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026376, 121025, 17203, '<td valign="top">Very clever of you to use noise and saturation to provide your brushstrokes. Good color palette and composition. The image could lean more toward pointillism than impressionism (which could cost you some votes), but a strong entry overall.</td>', 'Very clever of you to use noise and saturation to provide your brushstrokes. Good color palette and composition. The image could lean more toward pointillism than impressionism (which could cost you some votes), but a strong entry overall.', '2004-11-21 23:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026380, 117658, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is simply a beautiful image....the interaction of light and shadow are exquisite.  Very well-captured.  I am quite impressed!  :o)</td>', 'This is simply a beautiful image....the interaction of light and shadow are exquisite.  Very well-captured.  I am quite impressed!  :o)', '2004-11-21 23:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
