(1026449, 120752, 25355, '<td valign="top">One of my tens, too. Brilliantly achieved - and my impression was that it was an actual painting. Congratulations.</td>', 'One of my tens, too. Brilliantly achieved - and my impression was that it was an actual painting. Congratulations.', '2004-11-22 00:14:47.000000', NULL, 0),
