(1027440, 120752, 9932, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!<br/> <br/>I have to say in my attempt to vote all the photos and challenges you fooled me! I tried to pride myself by voting all on entries in the challenges and not just the minimum 20%. But from now on I will have to take more time in examining the photos even if it means not voting on all entries. This is the sad part of having so many entries and so many challenges to vote on and not enough time. I get the feeling that alot of Photgraphers are going to have some great shots slip through the cracks because of this present condition.</td>', 'Congratulations! I have to say in my attempt to vote all the photos and challenges you fooled me! I tried to pride myself by voting all on entries in the challenges and not just the minimum 20%. But from now on I will have to take more time in examining the photos even if it means not voting on all entries. This is the sad part of having so many entries and so many challenges to vote on and not enough time. I get the feeling that alot of Photgraphers are going to have some great shots slip through the cracks because of this present condition.', '2004-11-22 13:59:08.000000', NULL, 0),
