(1028393, 120512, 2780, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I submitted at the last minute and didn''t have time to write them. Basically, I used a dark strokes effect and a  brush strokes effect on different layers. I then erased different parts of each layer until each part of the photo had the amount of detail and darkness that I wanted it to have. I then dodged and burned and adjusted the hue/saturation slightly.</td>', 'Sorry, I submitted at the last minute and didn''t have time to write them. Basically, I used a dark strokes effect and a  brush strokes effect on different layers. I then erased different parts of each layer until each part of the photo had the amount of detail and darkness that I wanted it to have. I then dodged and burned and adjusted the hue/saturation slightly.', '2004-11-23 03:16:36.000000', NULL, 0),
