(1029608, 120706, 17203, '<td valign="top">You were robbed. Robbed, I tell ya! Looks like you were punished for lack of obvious strokes, but this is a perfectly valid example of <i>photographic</i> impressionism to me. It really was one of the best shots in this group.</td>', 'You were robbed. Robbed, I tell ya! Looks like you were punished for lack of obvious strokes, but this is a perfectly valid example of photographic impressionism to me. It really was one of the best shots in this group.', '2004-11-23 21:10:35.000000', NULL, 0),
