(1031060, 120208, 472, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your comments.<br/> <br/>Now, for the diatribe ;) :<br/> <br/>I think it was a big mistake to allow advanced editing in this challenge.  I think it should have been about making impressionistic images WITH YOUR CAMERA, not applying a canned filter effect to create a cheesy ''digital monet.''  <br/> <br/>&lt;/diatribe&gt;</td>', 'Thank you all for your comments. Now, for the diatribe ;) : I think it was a big mistake to allow advanced editing in this challenge.  I think it should have been about making impressionistic images WITH YOUR CAMERA, not applying a canned filter effect to create a cheesy ''digital monet.''   </diatribe>', '2004-11-24 09:56:25.000000', NULL, 0),
