(1035617, 120752, 12448, '<td valign="top">I have to admit, normally I''m not a big fan of Impressionism but this one is just fantastic!  I figured out how you did it when I saw it but it still was just so perfect!  The only thing that threw me was the easel backing but that was cleared up in the explaination.  Fantastic job, wonderful work and I just love it!<br/> <br/>Deannda</td>', 'I have to admit, normally I''m not a big fan of Impressionism but this one is just fantastic!  I figured out how you did it when I saw it but it still was just so perfect!  The only thing that threw me was the easel backing but that was cleared up in the explaination.  Fantastic job, wonderful work and I just love it! Deannda', '2004-11-28 23:52:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(1035620, 120706, 12448, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>It''s been a while since I''ve done any critiques, so bear with me here.  As I just told the blue ribbon winner for this challenge Impressionism is not one of my favorite types of art but this challenge opened my eyes to many possiblities.<br/> <br/>This is a really nice shot overall and the water and some of the leaves really come across with the impressionism feeling but there are more leaves that don''t.  It''s hard to explain but the sharper looking leaves take away from the rest of the shot.<br/> <br/>I don''t know what kind of post processing you did on this shot and I guess with impressionism it''s not supposed to be bright but the lack of any contrast despite the different color leaves seems off just a bit.<br/> <br/>I''m sorry you didn''t get someone who knows a little more about this type of shot but you got a lot of good critiques already.  <br/> <br/>Deannda</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! It''s been a while since I''ve done any critiques, so bear with me here.  As I just told the blue ribbon winner for this challenge Impressionism is not one of my favorite types of art but this challenge opened my eyes to many possiblities. This is a really nice shot overall and the water and some of the leaves really come across with the impressionism feeling but there are more leaves that don''t.  It''s hard to explain but the sharper looking leaves take away from the rest of the shot. I don''t know what kind of post processing you did on this shot and I guess with impressionism it''s not supposed to be bright but the lack of any contrast despite the different color leaves seems off just a bit. I''m sorry you didn''t get someone who knows a little more about this type of shot but you got a lot of good critiques already.   Deannda', '2004-11-28 23:57:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(1036873, 120752, 30062, '<td valign="top">it''s perfect!..I love it!...</td>', 'it''s perfect!..I love it!...', '2004-11-29 19:55:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1045383, 120752, 22384, '<td valign="top">Scalvert, you sly soul. You, too, are a master. I had visited DPChallenge many times with my students to help them learn to critique works of art, to hopefully see beyond the initial image, before I became a member. I remember many of these pieces. What a talent you are!</td>', 'Scalvert, you sly soul. You, too, are a master. I had visited DPChallenge many times with my students to help them learn to critique works of art, to hopefully see beyond the initial image, before I became a member. I remember many of these pieces. What a talent you are!', '2004-12-03 22:04:51.000000', NULL, 0),
