(1234061, 121132, 12611, '<td valign="top">I disagree with some of the comments here, I mean, are we talking photographic impressionism or the old masters? I like this piece a real lot and I think it exemplifies the way to use a camera to achieve the best results possible for a camera (and not fake another art style in a meaningless way)<br/>so, great job and underrated.</td>', 'I disagree with some of the comments here, I mean, are we talking photographic impressionism or the old masters? I like this piece a real lot and I think it exemplifies the way to use a camera to achieve the best results possible for a camera (and not fake another art style in a meaningless way)so, great job and underrated.', '2005-03-17 07:43:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(1236581, 121066, 33560, '<td valign="top">This really is quite and extraordinary shot.  I love the colors and the layers of space: the layer under the fluid, the fluid, the floating fluid, and the reflected image.  It''s like four parallel worlds.</td>', 'This really is quite and extraordinary shot.  I love the colors and the layers of space: the layer under the fluid, the fluid, the floating fluid, and the reflected image.  It''s like four parallel worlds.', '2005-03-18 17:26:44.000000', NULL, 0),
